    model_api_content_id: "52856c3a9a504927abe26b8bed85e3a5"
  }
  code_action {
    action_spec {
      create_file {
        instruction: "# Smart Attendance System\n\nA multi-organization, QR-based attendance platform built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Firebase (Authentication + Cloud Firestore). Supports a clean three-tier hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**), instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** language switching, dark mode, CSV bulk import, CSV/PDF reports, monthly register sheets, leave management, announcements, optional GPS location verification, and installable PWA support.\n\n---\n\n## Features\n\n- **Multi-Organization Hierarchy**: Strict data isolation across organizations. Customize role names per organization (e.g. *Teacher / Student*, *Faculty / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*).\n- **QR & Manual Attendance**: Continuous camera scanning (`html5-qrcode`) with sound + vibration feedback, front/back camera switch, 2-second duplicate cooldown, automatic \"Late\" detection after configurable cut-off time, optional GPS radius verification, and \"Mark all present\" bulk manual mode.\n- **Account Creation Without Signing Out**: Uses a secondary Firebase App instance (`initializeApp(config, \"secondary\")`) when Admins/Managers add people directly, automatically sending a password-setup reset email.\n- **Onboarding Options**: Direct add, CSV bulk import with validation preview, and self-registration via 6-character Organization Code or Manager Code (with approval workflow).\n- **QR & Printable ID Cards**: Deterministic JSON QR payloads `{ orgId, uid, memberId }`, crisp PNG download, and printable ID card view.\n- **Dashboards & Reports**: Role-specific dashboards, 7/30-day charts, low-attendance alerts, monthly member calendar, monthly register sheet view, CSV & PDF exports.\n- **Leave Requests, Notices & Notifications**: Approved leaves automatically appear as `Leave` on attendance calendars and reports.\n- **Bilingual (English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200)**: Instant switch in the header and landing page, persisted in `localStorage` and Firestore user profiles.\n- **Demo Data Controls**: Admin Settings includes **Load demo data** (3 Managers, 15 Members, 30 days of realistic attendance) and **Delete demo data**.\n\n---\n\n## Firebase Setup Steps (`attendence-92251`)\n\nThe Firebase web configuration is already configured in `src/firebase.ts`. Complete the following steps in the [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/) for project **`attendence-92251`**:\n\n### 1. Enable Email/Password Authentication\n1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Authentication \342\206\222 Sign-in method**.\n2. Enable **Email/Password** and click **Save**.\n3. Under **Authentication \342\206\222 Settings \342\206\222 Authorized domains**, add your deployed domain(s) (e.g. your Cloud Run / Firebase Hosting domain and `localhost` for local development).\n\n### 2. Create Cloud Firestore Database (`asia-south1`)\n1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Firestore Database \342\206\222 Create database**.\n2. Choose location **`asia-south1` (Mumbai)** (or your preferred region).\n3. Start in **Production mode**.\n\n### 3. Publish Firestore Security Rules\n1. Open **Firestore Database \342\206\222 Rules** (or deploy via Firebase CLI: `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules`).\n2. Copy the entire contents of `firestore.rules` from this repository and click **Publish**.\n\n### 4. Create Composite Indexes\nThe app uses equality-scoped queries so core screens work immediately. For optimal query performance at scale, deploy `firestore.indexes.json` (`firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes`) or create the following composite indexes in **Firestore \342\206\222 Indexes**:\n\n| Collection | Fields |\n|---|---|\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `role` (Asc) |\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc) |\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `date` (Desc) |\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |\n| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\n| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\n| `announcements` | `orgId` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\n| `notifications` | `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\n\n---\n\n## Local Development & Build\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nBuild for production:\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\n```\n\n> **Camera Note**: Browser camera access for QR scanning requires **HTTPS** (or `localhost`).\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```text\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firestore.rules           # Strict multi-tenant Firestore security rules\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firestore.indexes.json    # Composite Firestore index definitions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 public/                   # PWA icons (SVG + 180/192/512/maskable PNGs)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firebase.ts           # Firebase SDK + secondary app helper\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/                # TypeScript models\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 i18n/                 # en.json & hi.json dictionaries\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/              # Auth, Language, Theme, Toast contexts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 hooks/                # useTranslation, usePWAInstall, useOnlineStatus\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/             # Firestore services (org, user, attendance, leave, communication, demo)\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/                # Timezone, Haversine, audio/vibration, error mapping helpers\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/           # Layout, QRCardModal, PeopleManagerView, ProtectedRoute, toggles\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/                # Landing, Auth, Dashboards, Mark Attendance, Leaves, Notices, Reports, Settings\n```\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///README.md"
        }
        overwrite: true
      }
    }
    action_result {
      edit {
        diff {
          unified_diff {
            lines {
              text: "# Smart Attendance System"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "A multi-organization, QR-based attendance platform built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Firebase (Authentication + Cloud Firestore). Supports a clean three-tier hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**), instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** language switching, dark mode, CSV bulk import, CSV/PDF reports, monthly register sheets, leave management, announcements, optional GPS location verification, and installable PWA support."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## Features"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Multi-Organization Hierarchy**: Strict data isolation across organizations. Customize role names per organization (e.g. *Teacher / Student*, *Faculty / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **QR & Manual Attendance**: Continuous camera scanning (`html5-qrcode`) with sound + vibration feedback, front/back camera switch, 2-second duplicate cooldown, automatic \"Late\" detection after configurable cut-off time, optional GPS radius verification, and \"Mark all present\" bulk manual mode."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Account Creation Without Signing Out**: Uses a secondary Firebase App instance (`initializeApp(config, \"secondary\")`) when Admins/Managers add people directly, automatically sending a password-setup reset email."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Onboarding Options**: Direct add, CSV bulk import with validation preview, and self-registration via 6-character Organization Code or Manager Code (with approval workflow)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **QR & Printable ID Cards**: Deterministic JSON QR payloads `{ orgId, uid, memberId }`, crisp PNG download, and printable ID card view."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Dashboards & Reports**: Role-specific dashboards, 7/30-day charts, low-attendance alerts, monthly member calendar, monthly register sheet view, CSV & PDF exports."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Leave Requests, Notices & Notifications**: Approved leaves automatically appear as `Leave` on attendance calendars and reports."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Bilingual (English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200)**: Instant switch in the header and landing page, persisted in `localStorage` and Firestore user profiles."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Demo Data Controls**: Admin Settings includes **Load demo data** (3 Managers, 15 Members, 30 days of realistic attendance) and **Delete demo data**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## Firebase Setup Steps (`attendence-92251`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "The Firebase web configuration is already configured in `src/firebase.ts`. Complete the following steps in the [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/) for project **`attendence-92251`**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 1. Enable Email/Password Authentication"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Authentication \342\206\222 Sign-in method**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. Enable **Email/Password** and click **Save**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. Under **Authentication \342\206\222 Settings \342\206\222 Authorized domains**, add your deployed domain(s) (e.g. your Cloud Run / Firebase Hosting domain and `localhost` for local development)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 2. Create Cloud Firestore Database (`asia-south1`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Firestore Database \342\206\222 Create database**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. Choose location **`asia-south1` (Mumbai)** (or your preferred region)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. Start in **Production mode**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 3. Publish Firestore Security Rules"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. Open **Firestore Database \342\206\222 Rules** (or deploy via Firebase CLI: `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. Copy the entire contents of `firestore.rules` from this repository and click **Publish**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 4. Create Composite Indexes"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "The app uses equality-scoped queries so core screens work immediately. For optimal query performance at scale, deploy `firestore.indexes.json` (`firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes`) or create the following composite indexes in **Firestore \342\206\222 Indexes**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| Collection | Fields |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "|---|---|"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `role` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `date` (Desc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `announcements` | `orgId` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "| `notifications` | `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## Local Development & Build"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "```bash"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
