  planner_response {
    response: "**Smart Attendance System** is built, verified, and wired to your Firebase project (`attendence-92251`).\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Firebase & Multi-Organization Architecture**:\n  - Modular Firebase v9+ SDK with Email/Password authentication and Cloud Firestore, plus a secondary Firebase app instance for creating Manager/Member accounts without signing out the active user (and automatically sending password-setup reset emails).\n  - Strict multi-tenant isolation and role hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**) enforced both in the app and in `firestore.rules`, along with `orgCodes` / `managerCodes` lookup collections for safe self-registration.\n  - Atomic ID generation (`ORG-MGR-0001`, `ORG-MEM-0001`) via Firestore transactions, custom per-organization role labels (e.g., *Teacher / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*), and bulk CSV import with validation preview.\n- **QR & Manual Attendance**:\n  - Continuous camera QR scanning (`html5-qrcode`) with front/back camera switching, 2-second duplicate cooldown, sound beep + vibration feedback, live \"Scanned today\" counter, automatic \"Late\" detection after the configured cut-off time in the organization\'s timezone, and optional GPS radius check.\n  - Manual attendance tab with search, individual status buttons (`Present`, `Late`, `Absent`, `Leave`), notes, date selection (Admin any day, Manager same day), and bulk **Mark all present** selection.\n- **Dashboards, Reports & Workflows**:\n  - **Admin Dashboard**: Org-wide counts, 7/30-day attendance chart, manager status list, one-tap Org Code copy, pending approvals, and notices.\n  - **Manager Dashboard**: Own member metrics, weekly chart, low-attendance alerts (configurable threshold), own QR/ID card modal, invite code, pending approvals, and leave requests.\n  - **Member Dashboard**: Personal QR code with PNG download and printable ID Card, monthly percentage, attendance streak, interactive color-coded calendar, and history.\n  - **Reports**: Filterable Records table, Per-person Summary, Monthly Register Sheet (`1..31`), charts, and one-click **Export CSV** and **Export PDF**.\n  - **Leaves, Notices & Notifications**: Leave requests with parent approval/rejection (approved days automatically write `Leave` records to attendance), scoped notices, and realtime unread notification bell.\n  - **Demo Data Controls**: **Load demo data** (3 Managers, 15 Members, 30 days of attendance, sample leaves and notice) and **Delete demo data** inside Admin Settings.\n- **Editorial Design, Bilingual (EN | \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202) & PWA**:\n  - Calm editorial landing page (hero with QR card preview, 3 numbered steps, 6 features, 4 organization cards, 3 pillars, 5 FAQ accordions, Firestore contact form, footer) and responsive sidebar/bottom-nav workspace with light/dark mode toggle.\n  - Instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** switching across every page, form, error message, date, and number, persisted to `localStorage` and Firestore user profiles.\n  - Installable PWA with Web App Manifest, service worker, PNG/maskable/Apple touch icons, offline indicator, and in-app install button.\n\n### Firebase Console Setup Reminder\nBefore signing up in production, complete the checklist in `README.md` for project `attendence-92251`:\n1. Enable **Email/Password** under **Authentication \342\206\222 Sign-in method** and add your app domain under **Authorized domains**.\n2. Create **Cloud Firestore** (e.g., `asia-south1`).\n3. Publish the rules from `firestore.rules` in **Firestore \342\206\222 Rules** (and optionally deploy `firestore.indexes.json`)."
    message_id: "fQX_aqDsON6iqtsPv5KSmAU"
    modified_response: "**Smart Attendance System** is built, verified, and wired to your Firebase project (`attendence-92251`).\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Firebase & Multi-Organization Architecture**:\n  - Modular Firebase v9+ SDK with Email/Password authentication and Cloud Firestore, plus a secondary Firebase app instance for creating Manager/Member accounts without signing out the active user (and automatically sending password-setup reset emails).\n  - Strict multi-tenant isolation and role hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**) enforced both in the app and in `firestore.rules`, along with `orgCodes` / `managerCodes` lookup collections for safe self-registration.\n  - Atomic ID generation (`ORG-MGR-0001`, `ORG-MEM-0001`) via Firestore transactions, custom per-organization role labels (e.g., *Teacher / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*), and bulk CSV import with validation preview.\n- **QR & Manual Attendance**:\n  - Continuous camera QR scanning (`html5-qrcode`) with front/back camera switching, 2-second duplicate cooldown, sound beep + vibration feedback, live \"Scanned today\" counter, automatic \"Late\" detection after the configured cut-off time in the organization\'s timezone, and optional GPS radius check.\n  - Manual attendance tab with search, individual status buttons (`Present`, `Late`, `Absent`, `Leave`), notes, date selection (Admin any day, Manager same day), and bulk **Mark all present** selection.\n- **Dashboards, Reports & Workflows**:\n  - **Admin Dashboard**: Org-wide counts, 7/30-day attendance chart, manager status list, one-tap Org Code copy, pending approvals, and notices.\n  - **Manager Dashboard**: Own member metrics, weekly chart, low-attendance alerts (configurable threshold), own QR/ID card modal, invite code, pending approvals, and leave requests.\n  - **Member Dashboard**: Personal QR code with PNG download and printable ID Card, monthly percentage, attendance streak, interactive color-coded calendar, and history.\n  - **Reports**: Filterable Records table, Per-person Summary, Monthly Register Sheet (`1..31`), charts, and one-click **Export CSV** and **Export PDF**.\n  - **Leaves, Notices & Notifications**: Leave requests with parent approval/rejection (approved days automatically write `Leave` records to attendance), scoped notices, and realtime unread notification bell.\n  - **Demo Data Controls**: **Load demo data** (3 Managers, 15 Members, 30 days of attendance, sample leaves and notice) and **Delete demo data** inside Admin Settings.\n- **Editorial Design, Bilingual (EN | \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202) & PWA**:\n  - Calm editorial landing page (hero with QR card preview, 3 numbered steps, 6 features, 4 organization cards, 3 pillars, 5 FAQ accordions, Firestore contact form, footer) and responsive sidebar/bottom-nav workspace with light/dark mode toggle.\n  - Instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** switching across every page, form, error message, date, and number, persisted to `localStorage` and Firestore user profiles.\n  - Installable PWA with Web App Manifest, service worker, PNG/maskable/Apple touch icons, offline indicator, and in-app install button.\n\n### Firebase Console Setup Reminder\nBefore signing up in production, complete the checklist in `README.md` for project `attendence-92251`:\n1. Enable **Email/Password** under **Authentication \342\206\222 Sign-in method** and add your app domain under **Authorized domains**.\n2. Create **Cloud Firestore** (e.g., `asia-south1`).\n3. Publish the rules from `firestore.rules` in **Firestore \342\206\222 Rules** (and optionally deploy `firestore.indexes.json`)."
