  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing New Components**\n\nI\'m working on the new components and pages for the Live Rotating QR Session and Member `/mark` flow. I\'ve started with a clean Leaflet and OpenStreetMap map component, `LocationPickerMap.tsx`. It uses a draggable custom SVG pin marker, which is pretty neat. This avoids the API key complexities.\n\n\n**Refining Map Interactions**\n\nI\'ve been improving the map component, `LocationPickerMap.tsx`, particularly the dynamic radius display. I\'ve integrated a live amber circle that shows the radius in meters, updating smoothly with changes to the props or when the pin is dragged. Clicking anywhere updates the coordinates. I am also working on `StartAttendancePage.tsx`. It now checks for existing sessions, offers a setup mode with session title, duration, and radius settings, and integrates the GPS fetch and map with the draggable pin. There is also a link to a manual backup option for users without a functional GPS.\n\n\n**Implementing Projector Mode**\n\nI\'ve just implemented the Projector Mode! It\'s designed for both normal layout and true full-screen. Screen wake lock is automatically managed, re-acquiring on visibility changes and releasing on close. The interface displays a large, clear QR code, encoding the session ID and token, and a synchronized animated countdown ring. There\'s also a rotating 6-digit code. I write session secrets to the database and display a live attendance counter, along with remaining session time, extend and close session buttons and a real-time attendance list.\n\n\n**Reviewing `/mark` Flow**\n\nI\'m revisiting the `/mark` flow, specifically `MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`. I\'ve added URL query string handling for direct navigation to the \"Scan QR\" or \"Enter ID\" tabs. The component now automatically attempts to locate the user\'s parent session, offering a \"Check again\" option if none is active. A high-accuracy GPS check is now performed with feedback on accuracy and distance, marking the class attendance location with check or X marks. I\'m noting rejected attempts for debugging.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "4w3_aufmC_rrz7IP-6uciQE"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9119630132065929277"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport L from \'leaflet\';\\n\\ninterface LocationPickerMapProps {\\n  lat: number;\\n  lng: number;\\n  radius: number;\\n  onChange: (lat: number, lng: number) => void;\\n}\\n\\nconst pinIcon = L.divIcon({\\n  className: \'sas-map-pin\',\\n  html: `<div style=\\\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50% 50% 50% 0;background:#C25E00;border:3px solid #FFFFFF;transform:rotate(-45deg);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\\\"><div style=\\\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;transform:rotate(45deg);\\\"></div></div>`,\\n  iconSize: [28, 28],\\n  iconAnchor: [14, 28],\\n});\\n\\nexport const LocationPickerMap: React.FC<LocationPickerMapProps> = ({\\n  lat,\\n  lng,\\n  radius,\\n  onChange,\\n}) => {\\n  const containerRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const mapRef = useRef<L.Map | null>(null);\\n  const markerRef = useRef<L.Marker | null>(null);\\n  const circleRef = useRef<L.Circle | null>(null);\\n  const onChangeRef = useRef(onChange);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    onChangeRef.current = onChange;\\n  }, [onChange]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!containerRef.current || mapRef.current) return;\\n\\n    const map = L.map(containerRef.current, {\\n      center: [lat, lng],\\n      zoom: 17,\\n      zoomControl: true,\\n      attributionControl: true,\\n    });\\n\\n    L.tileLayer(\'https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\', {\\n      maxZoom: 19,\\n      attribution: \'&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors\',\\n    }).addTo(map);\\n\\n    const circle = L.circle([lat, lng], {\\n      radius,\\n      color: \'#C25E00\',\\n      fillColor: \'#C25E00\',\\n      fillOpacity: 0.16,\\n      weight: 2,\\n    }).addTo(map);\\n\\n    const marker = L.marker([lat, lng], {\\n      draggable: true,\\n      icon: pinIcon,\\n    }).addTo(map);\\n\\n    marker.on(\'dragend\', () => {\\n      const pos = marker.getLatLng();\\n      circle.setLatLng(pos);\\n      onChangeRef.current(Number(pos.lat.toFixed(6)), Number(pos.lng.toFixed(6)));\\n    });\\n\\n    map.on(\'click\', (e: L.LeafletMouseEvent) => {\\n      marker.setLatLng(e.latlng);\\n      circle.setLatLng(e.latlng);\\n      onChangeRef.current(Number(e.latlng.lat.toFixed(6)), Number(e.latlng.lng.toFixed(6)));\\n    });\\n\\n    mapRef.current = map;\\n    markerRef.current = marker;\\n    circleRef.current = circle;\\n\\n    // Fix tile layout after mount\\n    const timer = window.setTimeout(() => map.invalidateSize(), 150);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      window.clearTimeout(timer);\\n      map.remove();\\n      mapRef.current = null;\\n      markerRef.current = null;\\n      circleRef.current = null;\\n    };\\n    // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!mapRef.current || !markerRef.current || !circleRef.current) return;\\n    const current = markerRef.current.getLatLng();\\n    const moved = Math.abs(current.lat - lat) > 0.00001 || Math.abs(current.lng - lng) > 0.00001;\\n    if (moved) {\\n      markerRef.current.setLatLng([lat, lng]);\\n      circleRef.current.setLatLng([lat, lng]);\\n      mapRef.current.setView([lat, lng], mapRef.current.getZoom(), { animate: true });\\n    }\\n    circleRef.current.setRadius(radius);\\n  }, [lat, lng, radius]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      ref={containerRef}\\n      className=\\\"w-full h-64 sm:h-72 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 z-0\\\"\\n    />\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create interactive Leaflet + OpenStreetMap location picker with draggable pin and live radius circle\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/LocationPickerMap.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating LocationPickerMap component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create LocationPickerMap.tsx\"}"
