  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nWe are updating an already-working React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + Firebase (`attendence-92251`) web app called **\"Smart Attendance System\"** (multi-organization QR attendance platform with hierarchy `Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members`, English/Hindi toggle, dark mode, PWA, reports, leaves, announcements).\n\nThe Turn 2 update request has 6 requirements \342\200\224 keep everything that already works and implement ONLY these changes completely (no TODOs, no half-done items):\n1. **Home Page (`src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`)**:\n   - Replace every `\"Start free\"` / `\"Start free trial\"` CTA (top bar, hero, mobile menu, footer, etc.) with `\"Sign up\"` (Hindi: `\"\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\250 \340\244\205\340\244\252 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\"`). Keep `\"Login\"` too.\n   - Remove the mock QR card from the hero section. Replace it with a clean **\"Mark your attendance\"** card (Hindi: `\"\340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\274\340\244\277\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\217\340\244\201\"`) with one short line and two buttons: **\"Scan QR\"** (`/mark?tab=scan`) and **\"Enter ID\"** (`/mark?tab=code`). If not logged in, redirect to `/login` first and return to `/mark` (preserving query param) after login.\n2. **New 6-Character Unique ID (replaces `ORG-MEM-0001`)**:\n   - Format: 3 uppercase English letters + 3 digits (e.g. `PAN482`, `RAH071`).\n   - Letters: first 3 English letters of person\'s name (uppercase, ignoring spaces/symbols; pad with `X` if <3 letters). If typed in Hindi/non-English, ask for the English spelling for the ID.\n   - Digits: random 3 digits `000`\342\200\223`999`.\n   - Globally unique via Firestore transaction on `userIds/{ID}` \342\206\222 `{ uid, orgId, role }`. Retry up to 30 times, then change the 3rd letter.\n   - Same format for Admin, Managers, and Members. Show everywhere (profile, ID card, lists, reports, search).\n   - Personal ID-card QR now encodes `{ orgId, uid, id }`.\n3. **Live Rotating QR Session (primary way to mark attendance)**:\n   - Admin starts a session for Managers; Manager starts a session for own Members.\n   - Setup page: optional title, duration (`15 / 30 / 60 / 120` min), allowed radius (default 50m, range 20\342\200\223500m), high-accuracy GPS shown on a Leaflet + OpenStreetMap map (no API key) with draggable pin and radius circle.\n   - Projector mode screen (works full screen, uses Screen Wake Lock API): big QR changing every 10s with countdown ring, 6-digit live code below it changing in sync, live counter `\"Marked: X / Y\"`, real-time list of marked names, real-time `\"Rejected attempts\"` list, `\"Close session\"` and `\"Extend 10 min\"` buttons.\n   - QR content: `{ \"s\": sessionId, \"t\": token }` (128-bit token via `crypto.getRandomValues`, 6-digit live code).\n   - Every 10s starter writes `{ token, prevToken, code, prevCode, tokenUpdatedAt: serverTimestamp() }` to `sessionSecrets/{sessionId}`.\n   - Validity: current token/code valid max 15s after `tokenUpdatedAt`; previous token/code valid 5s after rotation.\n4. **Member / Manager Side: `/mark` (\"Mark your attendance\")**:\n   - Step 1 (automatic): request GPS, show `\"You are 12 m from the class \342\234\223\"` or `\"You are 340 m away \342\234\227\"`. If GPS accuracy > 100m, ask user to try again.\n   - Step 2: two tabs \342\200\224 **Scan QR** (camera scanner for live rotating QR) and **Enter ID** (6-char `\"Your ID\"` matching logged-in user\'s own ID + 6-digit `\"Live code\"`).\n   - Auto-detect active open session of the user\'s direct parent (Member \342\206\222 Manager, Manager \342\206\222 Admin).\n   - Big green `\"Attendance marked\"` success card (name, time, distance); clear translated errors; mark `\"late\"` if after org `lateAfter`.\n5. **Security in `firestore.rules` (No Cloud Functions \342\200\224 free plan)**:\n   - `sessions/{sessionId}` (readable by owner + direct children) and `sessionSecrets/{sessionId}` (readable/writable ONLY by owner).\n   - `attendance` create rule validates self-marking (`method in [\'live_qr\', \'live_code\']`), active direct child, open session not past `endsAt`, secret match within 15s / 5s, `personUid == request.auth.uid`, `timestamp == request.time`, deterministic ID `{orgId}_{date}_{personUid}`, flat-earth radius using `cosLat` + `math.sqrt` + `math.pow`, and atomic `sessionDevices/{sessionId_deviceId}` write (one device = one person per session).\n   - Log failed attempts to `attempts/{id}` shown on owner\'s session screen.\n   - Manual marking & ID-card QR scanning by Admin/Manager kept as BACKUP only, tagged `\"manual\"` and highlighted in yellow in reports.\n   - Org settings: default radius, default session duration, on/off switch for `\"Location check\"` (default ON).\n6. **Deliverables**: Updated `firestore.rules`, `firestore.indexes.json`, `en.json`, `hi.json`, `demoService.ts` (new 6-char IDs), and `README.md`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n\n### Completed in Turn 1 (verified compiling & lint-clean before Turn 2)\n- Full baseline app in `/src`: `firebase.ts` (exact config for `attendence-92251` + secondary app helper), contexts (`AuthContext`, `LanguageContext`, `ThemeContext`, `ToastContext`), hooks (`useTranslation`, `usePWAInstall`, `useOnlineStatus`), PWA (`vite-plugin-pwa`, `public/icon.svg`, PNG icons `180/192/512/maskable`), all dashboards, reports, leaves, announcements, settings, auth pages.\n- Skills previously read: `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `references/2_landing_marketing.md`, `references/3_saas_dashboard.md`, `/skills/system_skills/pwa_integration/SKILL.md`.\n\n### Completed in Turn 2 (not yet compiled/linted after these edits)\n- Installed packages: `leaflet` and `@types/leaflet` via `install_applet_package`.\n- `/src/index.css`: Added `@import \"leaflet/dist/leaflet.css\";` below `@import \"tailwindcss\";`.\n- `/src/types/index.ts`: Updated with `AttendanceMethod = \'live_qr\' | \'live_code\' | \'qr\' | \'manual\'`, `englishName`, `defaultSessionDuration`, `AttendanceSession`, `SessionSecret`, `AttendanceAttempt`, `LiveSessionQRPayload`, `QRPayload` (`id?`), and `AttendanceRecord` location/session/device fields.\n- `/src/utils/helpers.ts`: Added `generateSessionToken()`, `generateSixDigitCode()`, `extractIdPrefixFromName()`, `needsEnglishNameForId()`, `generateCandidateUserId()`, `getOrCreateDeviceId()`, `getFlatEarthDistanceMeters()`, and updated `getCurrentPosition()` to return `{ lat, lng, accuracy }`.\n- `/firestore.rules`: Completely updated with `userIds`, `sessions`, `sessionSecrets` (strictly owner-only), `sessionDevices` (write-once per `sessionId_deviceId`), `attempts`, `canSelfMarkAttendance(recordId)` helper (valid Firebase Rules v2 syntax with `let` inside helper function), flat-earth distance check using `cosLat`/`math.sqrt`/`math.pow`, 15s/5s rotating token check, and backup `manual`/`qr` parent path.\n- `/firestore.indexes.json`: Added composite indexes for `userIds` (`orgId, isDemo`), `sessions` (`orgId, ownerUid, status`), `attempts` (`orgId, sessionId, time`), `attendance` (`orgId, sessionId`).\n- `/src/i18n/en.json` and `/src/i18n/hi.json`: Updated completely with identical keys covering `\"Sign up\"` / `\"\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\250 \340\244\205\340\244\252 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\"`, `\"Mark your attendance\"` / `\"\340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\274\340\244\277\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\217\340\244\201\"`, 6-char ID / English spelling prompts, all `session.*`, `mark.*`, backup `attendance.*`, `reports.manualHighlightHint`, and `settings.*` strings.\n- `/src/services/userService.ts`: Replaced sequential counter with `allocateUniqueUserId` (transaction on `userIds/{ID}`, 30 retries then 3rd-letter rotation). Updated `addPersonDirect`, `selfRegisterUser`, `approvePendingUser`, `deleteUserProfile` (deletes `userIds/{memberId}`).\n- `/src/services/orgService.ts`: Updated `createOrganizationAndAdmin` to reserve a 6-char unique ID for Admin via `allocateUniqueUserId`, default `location.enabled: true`, `location.radius: 50`, `defaultSessionDuration: 30`.\n- `/src/services/demoService.ts`: Updated `loadDemoData` to allocate unique 6-char IDs in `userIds` (`isDemo: true`) and seed realistic `live_qr`, `live_code`, and `manual` records; updated `deleteDemoData` to also delete `userIds` with `isDemo == true`.\n- `/src/services/sessionService.ts` (NEW): Created complete live session service (`startAttendanceSession`, `rotateSessionSecret`, `extendAttendanceSession`, `closeAttendanceSession`, `fetchOpenSessionByOwner`, `findActiveParentSession`, realtime subscriptions `subscribeSession`, `subscribeSessionAttendance`, `subscribeSessionAttempts`, `logFailedAttempt`, and atomic `submitSelfAttendance` writing `attendance` + `sessionDevices` in one `writeBatch` with error diagnosis).\n- `/src/services/attendanceService.ts`: Updated backup `markAttendanceViaQR` to accept `{ orgId, uid, id }` and tag backup ID-card scans as `method: \'manual\'` (`note: \'ID Card QR backup\'`).\n- `/src/components/LocationPickerMap.tsx` (NEW): Created interactive Leaflet + OSM map with custom SVG draggable pin, click-to-move, and live radius circle.\n- `/src/pages/StartAttendancePage.tsx` (NEW): Created live rotating QR session setup + Projector Mode (fullscreen, Wake Lock API, 10s QR + 6-digit code rotation with SVG countdown ring, live Marked X/Y counter, realtime marked feed, realtime rejected attempts feed, Extend 10 min, Close session, link to `/attendance/manual`).\n- `/src/pages/MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx` (NEW): Created `/mark` page with auto-discovery of parent\'s active session, automatic Step 1 GPS check (`>100m` accuracy prompt, green `\"You are X m from the class \342\234\223\"` / red `\"You are X m away \342\234\227\"`), Step 2 tabs (`Scan QR` + `Enter ID` with own-ID validation + 6-digit live code), big green `\"Attendance marked\"` success card, and translated errors.\n\n### Remaining / Not Yet Edited in Turn 2\nNone of the existing pages/components below have been updated yet for Turn 2 (see Section 6 for exact per-file changes):\n- `/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`\n- `/src/components/ProtectedRoute.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx`\n- `/src/components/PeopleManagerView.tsx`\n- `/src/components/QRCardModal.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/MemberDashboard.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/ManagerDashboard.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/MarkAttendancePage.tsx` (backup manual / ID-card scanner page)\n- `/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx`\n- `/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`\n- `/src/components/Layout.tsx`\n- `/src/App.tsx`\n- `/README.md`\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Firestore Rules `let` restriction**: `let` statements are only valid inside function bodies in Firebase Rules v2, not inline inside `allow create: if (...)`. Already solved by extracting `canSelfMarkAttendance(recordId)` in `firestore.rules`.\n- **One-device-per-session without Cloud Functions**: Enforced atomically by writing `sessionDevices/{sessionId}_{deviceId}` and `attendance/{orgId}_{date}_{personUid}` in the same `writeBatch`. `sessionDevices` denies `update`, and `attendance` checks `existsAfter(...sessionDevices...) && getAfter(...).data.personUid == request.auth.uid`, preventing both overwriting and piggybacking.\n- **Leaflet in Vite**: Avoids default Leaflet marker PNG broken-path issues by using a custom `L.divIcon` SVG pin in `LocationPickerMap.tsx` and importing `leaflet/dist/leaflet.css` in `src/index.css`.\n- **Vite PWA workbox limit**: Unminified build (`vite build --minify false`) produces >5MB JS bundle; `workbox.maximumFileSizeToCacheInBytes` is already set to `10 * 1024 * 1024` in `vite.config.ts`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Turn 1 Build Error**: `vite-plugin-pwa` failed because unminified `assets/index-*.js` was 5.56 MB vs 5 MB limit. **Fixed** by increasing `maximumFileSizeToCacheInBytes` to `10 * 1024 * 1024` in `vite.config.ts`. Both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` then passed.\n- **Turn 2**: No build run yet (deferred until all Turn 2 file edits are complete).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- All Turn 2 services (`userService`, `orgService`, `demoService`, `sessionService`, `attendanceService`), types, utils, rules, indexes, translations (`en.json`, `hi.json`), and the two new core pages (`StartAttendancePage`, `MarkYourAttendancePage`) + `LocationPickerMap` are written and ready to be wired into the remaining UI pages and routes.\n- `src/pages/MarkAttendancePage.tsx` currently serves the old QR/Manual flow and should become the `/attendance/manual` backup page (with a clear yellow backup notice and `\"Back to Live Session\"` link to `/attendance`).\n\n---\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\nExecute these file edits in batches, then run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together:\n\n1. **`/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`**:\n   - Replace hero mock QR card with the clean **\"Mark your attendance\"** card (`t(\'landing.markCardTitle\')`, `t(\'landing.markCardSubtitle\')`) with two buttons: **\"Scan QR\"** (`Link to=\"/mark?tab=scan\"`) and **\"Enter ID\"** (`Link to=\"/mark?tab=code\"`). Remove unused `QRCodeSVG`/`Check` imports if no longer used.\n   - Verify all `\"Start free\"` buttons use `t(\'landing.ctaStart\')` (which is now `\"Sign up\"` / `\"\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\250 \340\244\205\340\244\252 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\"`) and `\"Login\"` button remains visible in top bar, mobile menu, and footer.\n2. **`/src/components/ProtectedRoute.tsx` & `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`**:\n   - In `ProtectedRoute.tsx`: when unauthenticated, redirect to `/login` passing `state={{ from: location.pathname + location.search }}` (or `?redirect=...`).\n   - In `LoginPage.tsx`: after login (in `useEffect` when `user && profile` become active), if `location.state?.from` (or `?redirect=`) is present (e.g. `/mark?tab=scan` or `/mark?tab=code`) and user is active (and not an Admin trying to visit `/mark`, or handle cleanly), navigate there instead of default dashboard!\n3. **`/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx` & `/src/components/PeopleManagerView.tsx`**:\n   - Use `needsEnglishNameForId(name)` from `src/utils/helpers.ts`: whenever the entered name contains no English letters (e.g., typed in Hindi), reveal a required **\"English spelling for ID\"** input (`t(\'common.englishNameLabel\')`, `t(\'common.englishNameHint\')`) and pass `englishName` to `createOrganizationAndAdmin`, `selfRegisterUser`, and `addPersonDirect` (and CSV import row parsing for optional `englishName` column).\n   - Validate with `t(\'errors.englishNameRequired\')` if `needsEnglishNameForId(name)` is true and `englishName` has no English letters.\n4. **`/src/components/QRCardModal.tsx` & `/src/pages/MemberDashboard.tsx`**:\n   - Update personal ID-card QR JSON payload from `{ orgId, uid, memberId }` to **`{ orgId, uid, id: person.memberId }`** in both `QRCardModal.tsx` and `MemberDashboard.tsx`.\n   - In `MemberDashboard.tsx`: add a prominent **\"Mark your attendance\"** button (`Link to=\"/mark\"`) at the top alongside the QR card.\n5. **`/src/pages/ManagerDashboard.tsx`**:\n   - Ensure the primary CTA says **\"Start attendance\"** (`/attendance`) and add a clean **\"Mark your attendance\"** button (`Link to=\"/mark\"`) so Managers can easily mark their own attendance in the Admin\'s live session!\n6. **`/src/pages/MarkAttendancePage.tsx`**:\n   - Add a calm amber backup banner (`t(\'attendance.backupNotice\')`) and a **\"Back to Live Session\"** link (`Link to=\"/attendance\"`), keeping both tabs (`Scan ID Card QR` and `Manual` + `Mark all present`) intact as backup mode.\n7. **`/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx`**:\n   - Highlight rows where `r.method === \'manual\'` with a clear yellow/amber tint (`bg-amber-50/70 dark:bg-amber-950/25`) and yellow/amber method text (`text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 font-semibold`), plus display `t(\'reports.manualHighlightHint\')` above the Records table.\n   - Ensure `r.method` translates cleanly for all 4 methods (`live_qr`, `live_code`, `qr`, `manual`) \342\200\224 keys already exist in `en.json` and `hi.json`.\n   - Ensure PDF & CSV exports show the 6-char ID (`memberId`) and method clearly.\n8. **`/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`**:\n   - In Organization Settings (Admin only), add **Default session duration** (`15 / 30 / 60 / 120` min -> `org.defaultSessionDuration`), **Default allowed radius** (`20`\342\200\223`500` m -> `org.location.radius`, default `50`), and keep the **Location check** on/off toggle (default ON, `org.location.enabled ?? true`). Show user\'s own 6-char ID clearly in the Profile section.\n9. **`/src/components/Layout.tsx`**:\n   - Update Admin & Manager primary sidebar CTA to **\"Start attendance\"** (`t(\'nav.startAttendance\')` -> `/attendance`).\n   - Add **\"Mark attendance\"** (`t(\'nav.markYourAttendance\')` -> `/mark`) to Member navigation (first/primary action!) AND Manager navigation so both can reach `/mark` easily on desktop and mobile.\n   - Add a **\"Manual backup\"** (`/attendance/manual`) nav link or keep it accessible from `StartAttendancePage` (also good in sidebar under Reports/Attendance if space permits without cluttering mobile bottom nav).\n10. **`/src/App.tsx`**:\n    - Wire `/attendance` \342\206\222 `<StartAttendancePage />` (Admin & Manager).\n    - Wire `/attendance/manual` \342\206\222 `<MarkAttendancePage />` (Admin & Manager).\n    - Wire `/mark` \342\206\222 `<MarkYourAttendancePage />` (Manager & Member \342\200\224 and if Admin opens `/mark`, redirect to `/attendance` or allow ProtectedRoute cleanly so Admin isn\'t stuck).\n11. **`/README.md`**:\n    - Update documentation with new collections (`userIds`, `sessions`, `sessionSecrets`, `sessionDevices`, `attempts`), updated composite indexes table, 6-char ID format, live rotating QR session & zero-Cloud-Functions security model.\n12. **Final Verification**:\n    - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in parallel and fix any TypeScript or build issues (max 3 attempts).\n\n---\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Do NOT break any existing working features (roles, hierarchy, dashboards, reports, leaves, announcements, Hindi/English toggle, dark mode, Firebase config in `src/firebase.ts`, PWA).\n- Do NOT use Cloud Functions (free Firebase plan \342\200\224 all live session security must live in `firestore.rules`).\n- Use Leaflet + OpenStreetMap (no Google Maps API key).\n- Keep the calm, minimal editorial UI aesthetic (no static pill badges, tabular numerals, WCAG AA contrast in both light & dark mode, concise 1\342\200\2233 word buttons).\n- Complete every requirement with zero TODOs or fake buttons.\n</summary>"
