  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Parallel Edits**\n\nI\'m now implementing the edits in batch two across the specified files. Specifically, I\'m updating the personal ID-card QR JSON payload in `/src/pages/MemberDashboard.tsx` to include `id: profile.memberId`. I\'ve added a prominent element to highlight this change. The edits are progressing, targeting seven files.\n\n\n**Implementing Attendance Features**\n\nI\'m focusing on enhancing attendance marking. I\'ve integrated a \"Mark your attendance\" CTA at the top of the Member Dashboard for easy access. In the Manager Dashboard, I\'ve introduced a \"Mark attendance\" button alongside \"Start attendance.\" I\'m also adding a backup notice banner and a \"Back to Live Session\" link on the Mark Attendance page. Finally, I\'m highlighting manually recorded attendance entries in the Reports page with an amber tint.\n\n\n**Refining Admin Controls**\n\nI\'m now integrating enhanced admin settings. I\'ve focused on `/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`, displaying the user\'s unique ID clearly. Admins can now also view their own ID and QR code. I\'m adding \"Default session duration\" and \"Default allowed radius\" options under organization settings and making the location check more intuitive. Additionally, I\'ve updated the sidebar CTA and nav items in `/src/components/Layout.tsx` for improved navigation.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ohH_arGnMZHQz7IP2JmRyQo"
