  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reflecting Turn 2 Changes**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/README.md` to perfectly capture the Turn 2 advancements. Key additions are the implementation of a new 6-character unique ID system with lookup transaction, and the incorporation of a live rotating QR session. The latter features a 10-second rotation, a 6-digit code, and Leaflet + OpenStreetMap for radius display.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "8RH_auX4Hqu5qtsPhpaDkA4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5019446107577285045"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# Smart Attendance System\\n\\nA multi-organization, QR-based attendance platform built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet (OpenStreetMap), and Firebase (Authentication + Cloud Firestore \342\200\224 Spark/free plan compatible, zero Cloud Functions required). Supports a clean three-tier hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**), instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** language switching, dark mode, CSV bulk import, CSV/PDF reports, monthly register sheets, leave management, announcements, live rotating QR sessions with GPS verification, and installable PWA support.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n- **Multi-Organization Hierarchy**: Strict data isolation across organizations. Customize role names per organization (e.g. *Teacher / Student*, *Faculty / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*).\\n- **Globally Unique 6-Character ID**: Every Admin, Manager, and Member receives a unique 6-character ID (`3 uppercase English letters + 3 digits`, e.g. `PAN482`, `RAH071`) reserved atomically via a Firestore transaction in `userIds/{ID}`. If a name is typed in Hindi, the form asks for the English spelling used for the ID.\\n- **Live Rotating QR Sessions (Primary Attendance Mode)**:\\n  - Admins start sessions for Managers; Managers start sessions for their own Members.\\n  - Setup includes optional title, duration (`15 / 30 / 60 / 120` min), allowed radius (`20 \342\200\223 500` m, default `50` m), and high-accuracy GPS plotted on an interactive **Leaflet + OpenStreetMap** map (no API key needed) with a draggable pin and radius circle.\\n  - **Projector Mode**: Full-screen view with Screen Wake Lock API, large QR rotating every **10 seconds** (`{ \\\"s\\\": sessionId, \\\"t\\\": token }`) with a countdown ring, synchronized **6-digit live code**, live `\\\"Marked: X / Y\\\"` counter, real-time marked feed, real-time `\\\"Rejected attempts\\\"` list, `\\\"Extend 10 min\\\"`, and `\\\"Close session\\\"`.\\n- **Self-Marking Page (`/mark`)**:\\n  - Automatic GPS verification (`\\\"You are 12 m from the class \342\234\223\\\"` / `\\\"You are 340 m away \342\234\227\\\"`), rejecting readings with accuracy > 100 m.\\n  - Two tabs: **Scan QR** (live rotating QR camera scanner) and **Enter ID** (6-char own ID + 6-digit live code).\\n  - Automatically marks **Late** after the organization\'s `lateAfter` cut-off time.\\n- **Zero-Cloud-Functions Security (`firestore.rules`)**:\\n  - Rotating secrets stored in `sessionSecrets/{sessionId}` (readable/writable only by the session starter, verified server-side by Firestore Security Rules).\\n  - Current token/code valid max 15 seconds; previous token/code valid 5 seconds after rotation for network delay.\\n  - Server-side flat-earth radius check (`cosLat`, `math.sqrt`, `math.pow`) enforced in `firestore.rules`.\\n  - Atomic one-device-per-session lock via `sessionDevices/{sessionId}_{deviceId}` written in the same `writeBatch` as the attendance record.\\n  - Failed attempts logged to `attempts/{id}` and shown live on the session screen.\\n- **Manual / ID-Card Backup (`/attendance/manual`)**:\\n  - Personal ID card QR encodes `{ orgId, uid, id }`.\\n  - Records marked manually or via backup ID-card scan are tagged `\\\"manual\\\"` and highlighted in yellow in Reports (both on-screen and in PDF exports).\\n- **Account Creation Without Signing Out**: Uses a secondary Firebase App instance (`initializeApp(config, \\\"secondary\\\")`) when Admins/Managers add people directly, automatically sending a password-setup reset email.\\n- **Dashboards, Reports, Leaves & Notices**: Role-specific dashboards, 7/30-day charts, low-attendance alerts, monthly member calendar, monthly register sheet view, CSV & PDF exports, leave approvals, and announcements.\\n- **Bilingual (English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200) & PWA**: Instant switch in header and landing page, persisted in `localStorage` and Firestore user profiles.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Firebase Setup Steps (`attendence-92251`)\\n\\nThe Firebase web configuration is already configured in `src/firebase.ts`. Complete the following steps in the [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/) for project **`attendence-92251`**:\\n\\n### 1. Enable Email/Password Authentication\\n1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Authentication \342\206\222 Sign-in method**.\\n2. Enable **Email/Password** and click **Save**.\\n3. Under **Authentication \342\206\222 Settings \342\206\222 Authorized domains**, add your deployed domain(s) (e.g. your Cloud Run / Firebase Hosting domain and `localhost` for local development).\\n\\n### 2. Create Cloud Firestore Database (`asia-south1`)\\n1. Open **Build \342\206\222 Firestore Database \342\206\222 Create database**.\\n2. Choose location **`asia-south1` (Mumbai)** (or your preferred region).\\n3. Start in **Production mode**.\\n\\n### 3. Publish Firestore Security Rules\\n1. Open **Firestore Database \342\206\222 Rules** (or deploy via Firebase CLI: `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules`).\\n2. Copy the entire contents of `firestore.rules` from this repository and click **Publish**.\\n\\n### 4. Create Composite Indexes\\nDeploy `firestore.indexes.json` (`firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes`) or create the following composite indexes in **Firestore \342\206\222 Indexes**:\\n\\n| Collection | Fields |\\n|---|---|\\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `role` (Asc) |\\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc) |\\n| `users` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |\\n| `userIds` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |\\n| `sessions` | `orgId` (Asc), `ownerUid` (Asc), `status` (Asc) |\\n| `attempts` | `orgId` (Asc), `sessionId` (Asc), `time` (Desc) |\\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |\\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `sessionId` (Asc) |\\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `managerId` (Asc), `date` (Asc) |\\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `date` (Desc) |\\n| `attendance` | `orgId` (Asc), `isDemo` (Asc) |\\n| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\\n| `leaves` | `orgId` (Asc), `personUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\\n| `announcements` | `orgId` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\\n| `notifications` | `toUid` (Asc), `createdAt` (Desc) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Local Development & Build\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm install\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nBuild for production:\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm run build\\n```\\n\\n> **Camera & GPS Note**: Browser camera access for QR scanning and high-accuracy GPS require **HTTPS** (or `localhost`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Project Structure\\n\\n```text\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firestore.rules           # Multi-tenant + live rotating QR & GPS security rules (no Cloud Functions)\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firestore.indexes.json    # Composite Firestore index definitions\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 public/                   # PWA icons (SVG + 180/192/512/maskable PNGs)\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 firebase.ts           # Firebase SDK + secondary app helper\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/                # TypeScript models (Org, User, Session, Secret, Attempt, Attendance)\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 i18n/                 # en.json & hi.json dictionaries\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/              # Auth, Language, Theme, Toast contexts\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 hooks/                # useTranslation, usePWAInstall, useOnlineStatus\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/             # org, user, session, attendance, leave, communication, demo services\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/                # 6-char ID generator, crypto token/code, GPS/flat-earth distance, audio/vibration\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/           # Layout, LocationPickerMap, QRCardModal, PeopleManagerView, ProtectedRoute\\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/                # Landing, Auth, Dashboards, StartAttendance, MarkYourAttendance, Backup, Reports, Settings\\n```\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update README.md with live rotating QR sessions, 6-char unique IDs, security rules, and composite indexes\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/README.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating README documentation\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update README.md\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\201\a\n\376\006\001i\024}\023\3206\213\017J\270s\211 <\224a\271\\\257N\020\323/<9\237\006\270\223\032\004P\f\"\226u\310A3\255\3525>E2\271\315:]\257\375Yt\0063\353\312\344\252\300\364\b\3565jrZ\231\201\fH\253\022i\fh,\204\246\366`\273\302\\\327\372\346t\'Y\327\253\203\213\226\354\355Qf\217+G\275\227\370Q\267k\262EN\200\367\211\032\376\263\216+\023\300\275\206\305\f\002\274\346\237\243\024\357\204Y\375hM\a@N\2646\026\246\027\201\370`\3375\n*\025P\213\236\242\363\374\2353Vc\203\373\311\307\214P\22499\207\223\341>\034\026STo\350\312\317\375\202\245\313\023\273\232\306\222xw\364\024\204\331\3365j\210\233\2627\027\305\003\335\227nS\337\327>+\314iA7i\375\001\310\270>_\344n\312\260:\223A/\334p\006\232\n\220Q\365k\356^\206Y\'E2\251\333#\372\022^]\370\025\373Y\233\006\v\030\351\226\370\204\377~\2360WNA\034)Yu_\262Fkx\017xYLwKFWG\004\307\214\331\336\364\373\034\3618\316\324<yHZ\365\363\221\214\006\031\221@\314\236T\004x\252\264\240\270\365\246\367A\246s}lo=\026\217R4\375\340\304\2015\307\3511\254\245U\365z\323\323z\246\345#\332\311\306\204\363F\025\333?\220\3478\033\036t|\266\240w\346yB\3369\337\204\230Lu\017D\377\236\023J\0379\367~\364B\341\316\332*\226\266\263\241\270\023\257\202\320[\204\232(%\2208\312g\230\327\214\326\3705\034[.\216X\261D\333YA\341p\021\232\355]\277\301\370u\ay\273\317\325\362\205\334\237\016=\272/\354S\035y\334IS/\323@\\\353w,p\005<\340\365\"\260_\271\223\260T\311\216\036\243\022\367\'\036\033>q^KZ\034\027\205\302\213\024\352&\"\0229ZS\021\20492\356\233&\036*\260|\275\243\336V\'DC\332\353\3645@\332}?\335\211\240\236\361\f\005\022@\366\357\022\333\347-\241\225\376\2372L\000\036\336\330\016\345\n\210\311\017\021\"\312P\201\211L\026\305\231s\004f7P\377\211IJ\254\234\201)T\300\275\343r\203\303\313\245Y\311@\320M\372\265\302\371  \266G\"I!\327\263\325f\325\217>\356\002&H\332=~|t\242l\217z\212\'\002\nQ\022\224\023\213+R\364}\313^\320\344)\345\355=\302\3044eq3\325\340\302\300<G\313\327I\376.\371\'\357-\360\203\326\303&\211\363\342