  planner_response {
    response: "**Smart Attendance System** has been updated with all requested changes while preserving all existing dashboards, reports, leave approvals, notices, dark mode, English/Hindi toggle, Firebase configuration, and PWA support:\n\n### Summary of Updates\n- **Home Page & Auth Redirects**\n  - Replaced every `\"Start free\"` / `\"Start free trial\"` CTA with **\"Sign up\"** (Hindi: **\"\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\250 \340\244\205\340\244\252 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\"**) while keeping **\"Login\"** accessible in the top bar, mobile menu, and footer.\n  - Replaced the hero mock QR card with a clean **\"Mark your attendance\"** card (Hindi: **\"\340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\274\340\244\277\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\217\340\244\201\"**) featuring **\"Scan QR\"** (`/mark?tab=scan`) and **\"Enter ID\"** (`/mark?tab=code`). Unauthenticated users are routed to Login first and returned directly to `/mark` afterward.\n- **Globally Unique 6-Character ID (`ABC123`)**\n  - Implemented `3 uppercase English letters + 3 random digits` (e.g., `PAN482`, `RAH071`) across Admin, Managers, Members, and demo data, reserved atomically via a Firestore transaction in `userIds/{ID}` (30 digit retries before rotating the third letter).\n  - Registration, Add Person, and CSV bulk import automatically ask for an **English spelling for ID** whenever a name is entered in Hindi/non-English characters.\n  - Personal ID card QR codes now encode `{ orgId, uid, id }`.\n- **Live Rotating QR Session (`/attendance`)**\n  - Setup flow asks for optional title, duration (`15 / 30 / 60 / 120` min), allowed radius (`20 \342\200\223 500` m, default `50` m), and high-accuracy GPS rendered on an interactive **Leaflet + OpenStreetMap** map (no API key required) with a draggable pin and live radius circle.\n  - **Projector Mode** supports full screen and the Screen Wake Lock API, rotating the QR (`{ \"s\": sessionId, \"t\": token }` with 128-bit crypto tokens) and synchronized 6-digit live code every **10 seconds** with a countdown ring, live `\"Marked: X / Y\"` counter, real-time marked feed, real-time `\"Rejected attempts\"` list, `\"Extend 10 min\"`, and `\"Close session\"`.\n- **Member / Manager Self-Marking (`/mark`)**\n  - Auto-detects the active open session of the user\'s direct parent (Member \342\206\222 Manager, Manager \342\206\222 Admin).\n  - Runs an automatic GPS check showing `\"You are X m from the class \342\234\223\"` or `\"You are X m away \342\234\227\"` (prompting to retry if GPS accuracy is > 100 m), followed by **Scan QR** and **Enter ID** (own 6-char ID + 6-digit live code) tabs, automatic `\"Late\"` detection after `lateAfter`, and a green `\"Attendance marked\"` confirmation card.\n- **Zero-Cloud-Functions Security & Backup Mode**\n  - Updated `firestore.rules` and `firestore.indexes.json` with strict owner-only `sessionSecrets/{sessionId}`, 15-second current / 5-second previous token grace window, server-side flat-earth radius verification (`cosLat`, `math.sqrt`, `math.pow`), atomic one-device-per-session enforcement via `sessionDevices/{sessionId}_{deviceId}`, and `attempts/{id}` logging.\n  - Kept manual marking and ID-card QR scanning as backup mode (`/attendance/manual`), tagged `\"manual\"` and highlighted in yellow in Reports (table and PDF export).\n  - Added **Default session duration**, **Default allowed radius**, and the **Location check** on/off toggle (default ON) in Organization Settings, along with complete English/Hindi translations (`en.json`, `hi.json`) and updated `README.md`.\n\n> **Reminder**: Publish the updated `firestore.rules` and deploy/create the new composite indexes listed in `firestore.indexes.json` / `README.md` in the Firebase Console for project `attendence-92251`."
    message_id: "jRL_aueLJPSU6dkPzvr-qA0"
