            lines {
              text: "# Smart Attendance System"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "A multi-organization, QR-based attendance platform built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet (OpenStreetMap), and Firebase (Authentication + Cloud Firestore \342\200\224 Spark/free plan compatible, zero Cloud Functions required). Supports a clean three-tier hierarchy (**Organization Admin \342\206\222 Managers \342\206\222 Members**), instant **English / \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200** language switching, dark mode, CSV bulk import, CSV/PDF reports, monthly register sheets, leave management, announcements, live rotating QR sessions with GPS verification, and installable PWA support."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "## Features"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Multi-Organization Hierarchy**: Strict data isolation across organizations. Customize role names per organization (e.g. *Teacher / Student*, *Faculty / Student*, *Team Lead / Employee*)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Globally Unique 6-Character ID**: Every Admin, Manager, and Member receives a unique 6-character ID (`3 uppercase English letters + 3 digits`, e.g. `PAN482`, `RAH071`) reserved atomically via a Firestore transaction in `userIds/{ID}`. If a name is typed in Hindi, the form asks for the English spelling used for the ID."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Live Rotating QR Sessions (Primary Attendance Mode)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Admins start sessions for Managers; Managers start sessions for their own Members."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Setup includes optional title, duration (`15 / 30 / 60 / 120` min), allowed radius (`20 \342\200\223 500` m, default `50` m), and high-accuracy GPS plotted on an interactive **Leaflet + OpenStreetMap** map (no API key needed) with a draggable pin and radius circle."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Projector Mode**: Full-screen view with Screen Wake Lock API, large QR rotating every **10 seconds** (`{ \"s\": sessionId, \"t\": token }`) with a countdown ring, synchronized **6-digit live code**, live `\"Marked: X / Y\"` counter, real-time marked feed, real-time `\"Rejected attempts\"` list, `\"Extend 10 min\"`, and `\"Close session\"`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Self-Marking Page (`/mark`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Projector Mode**: Full-screen view with Screen Wake Lock API, visible **LIVE** status indicator, large QR rotating every **10 seconds** (`{ \"s\": sessionId, \"t\": token }` with 128-bit crypto tokens) with a circular countdown ring and 10s timer, synchronized **6-digit live code**, live `\"Marked: X / Y\"` counter, real-time marked feed, real-time `\"Rejected attempts\"` list, `\"Extend 10 min\"`, and `\"Stop session\"` (immediately invalidates the active token)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Self-Marking & QR Scanner (`/mark`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
