            lines {
              text: "  - Automatically marks **Late** after the organization\'s `lateAfter` cut-off time."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Zero-Cloud-Functions Security (`firestore.rules`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Rotating secrets stored in `sessionSecrets/{sessionId}` (readable/writable only by the session starter, verified server-side by Firestore Security Rules)."
