  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Required Skills**\n\nI\'m currently cross-referencing the requested system upgrade with our skill inventory. So far, I\'ve identified several skills we *won\'t* need, specifically `applet-seo`, `cloudsql-*`, and `figma-import`. The focus is now on what skillsets are *directly* requested. I\'ll need to figure out what the *Firebase* integration will entail.\n\n\n**Identifying Frontend Needs**\n\nI\'ve determined that the `ProvisionFirebase` RPC is unnecessary, given the existing configuration and user instructions. The major focus shifts to `frontend-design`, triggered by UI/UX modernization requests for a premium SaaS dashboard. I\'m going to review the relevant skill documentation, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, to determine the precise skillsets needed.\n\n\n"
