    thinking: "**Initiating Upgrades**\n\nI\'ve successfully installed the `xlsx` library; the stage is now set to execute upgrades in organized batches. I\'m focusing on the first batch, which encompasses foundation, typography, schema, helpers, security rules, and indexes. I\'ll begin by updating `index.html`.\n\n\n**Refining Styling and Types**\n\nI\'m now integrating the updated styles from `src/index.css`, incorporating new fonts and a crisp SaaS design. Concurrently, I\'m working on the type definitions in `src/types/index.ts`, focusing on the `AttendanceStatus`, `UserRole`, and various academic entities. This includes strict enum values and detailed type definitions for related entities. I am expanding the models to support the new academic entities.\n\n\n"
