  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nThe user requested a complete, production-quality upgrade of their existing **Smart Attendance System** (`attendence-92251` Firebase project, React 19 + Vite 8 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4) into a **Smart Campus Attendance Management System**, preserving existing working functionality and keeping full **Firebase Spark (free) plan compatibility**.\n\n### Core Requirements & Strict Constraints\n1. **CRITICAL \342\200\224 Remove Unwanted Features Completely**:\n   - **Remove LATE attendance status completely** from frontend, backend, `firestore.rules`, reports, analytics, charts, filters, notifications, settings, demo data, and i18n.\n   - Support **ONLY 3 attendance statuses**: `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE` (`\'present\' | \'absent\' | \'leave\'`). Legacy `\'late\'` records in Firestore are normalized safely to `\'present\'` via `normalizeAttendanceStatus()`.\n   - **STRICTLY NO Face Recognition, Facial Verification, Biometric Auth, Face Enrollment, Facial Embeddings, Liveness Detection, or Biometric Data Storage.** Keep QR + GPS + Auth verification only.\n2. **Fix Live Attendance Session Issue (\"No active session right now...\")**:\n   - Fix root causes in `firestore.rules`, `sessionService.ts`, `StartAttendancePage.tsx`, `MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`, and `MemberDashboard.tsx`.\n   - Real-time `onSnapshot()` updates when teachers start/close sessions, handling `loading`, `empty`, `permission-denied`, `network`, `index-required`, and `expired` states separately, with a working **Check again** retry button and proper listener cleanup.\n3. **Multiple Teachers & Independent Subject-Wise Attendance**:\n   - Multiple teachers independently start/manage subject-wise live sessions on the same day (e.g., Teacher 1 Mathematics 9\342\200\22310 AM, Teacher 2 Programming 10\342\200\22311 AM for BCA AI & DS Sem 2 Sec C).\n   - Independent `sessionId` per session; deterministic attendance doc ID `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${personUid}` so Mathematics NEVER overwrites Programming, while preventing duplicates within the same session.\n   - Students see ONLY sessions relevant to their assigned class/section (or legacy direct `managerId`).\n4. **Teacher Dashboard (`/manager`)**: My Classes, My Assigned Subjects, My Lectures (from timetable), Start Attendance, Active Sessions, Today\'s Attendance, Attendance History, Subject-wise Reports, PRESENT/ABSENT/LEAVE counts, real-time live session tracking. Teachers can only access their assigned classes/subjects.\n5. **Student Dashboard (`/member`)**: Student Profile, Digital Student ID Card with QR & PDF download (ID QR cannot independently authorize self-attendance), Today\'s Lectures (Subject, Teacher, Time, `PRESENT`/`ABSENT`/`LEAVE`/`NOT STARTED`, Live Session indicator), Active Attendance Sessions (auto-updating in real time), Subject-wise %, Overall %, 75% shortage warning, Attendance History, Leave History, Weekly Timetable.\n6. **5-Role RBAC**: `super_admin` (Manage organizations & system settings), `admin` (Org Admin: departments, classes/sections, subjects, faculty assignments, timetables, users, parent links, analytics, reports, audit logs), `manager` (Teacher/Faculty), `member` (Student), `parent` (Parent Portal: read-only linked child\'s attendance, subject breakdown, history, leave status, low-attendance alerts, report export).\n7. **Additional Features**:\n   - Digital Student ID Card (photo upload via Spark-compatible compressed data URL, enrollment/roll number, dept/course/sem/sec, college name/logo, QR, downloadable PDF).\n   - Academic Structure management (`/academics`): Departments, Classes/Courses/Semesters/Sections/Classrooms, Subjects, Faculty-to-Subject/Class Assignments, Student class enrollment.\n   - Smart Timetable Integration (`/timetable`): Weekly Mon\342\200\223Sat grid, conflict detection (teacher, class, room overlap), one-click Start Live Session from timetable slot, faculty reminders, duplicate session prevention.\n   - Low Attendance Alert System: Default 75% (admin-configurable), subject-wise shortage detection, deduplicated notifications (`lowatt_{orgId}_{YYYY-MM}_{studentUid}_{targetUid}`) sent to Student, Faculty, and Verified Parents.\n   - Complete Immutable Audit Log System (`/audit-logs`): Append-only `auditLogs` collection (`allow update: if false; allow delete: if false;` in `firestore.rules`).\n   - Professional Excel (`.xlsx` via SheetJS) & branded PDF reporting (`ReportsPage.tsx`) with date range, department, class, subject, student, and PRESENT/ABSENT/LEAVE filters.\n   - Modernized SaaS UI/UX (light/dark mode, responsive PWA, tabular numerals, clean empty/loading/error states, English & Hindi i18n).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n\n### Skills & Reference Files Read\n- Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` and `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`.\n- Inspected all existing core files (`package.json`, `firestore.rules`, `firestore.indexes.json`, `index.html`, `src/index.css`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/firebase.ts`, `src/types/index.ts`, `src/context/AuthContext.tsx`, `src/utils/helpers.ts`, all 7 files in `src/services/`, `Layout.tsx`, `ProtectedRoute.tsx`, `QRCardModal.tsx`, `PeopleManagerView.tsx`, `AdminDashboard.tsx`, `ManagerDashboard.tsx`, `MemberDashboard.tsx`, `StartAttendancePage.tsx`, `MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`, `MarkAttendancePage.tsx`, `ReportsPage.tsx`, `SettingsPage.tsx`, `RegisterPage.tsx`, `LoginPage.tsx`, `LeavesPage.tsx`).\n\n### Completed Changes (Saved on Disk \342\200\224 NOT Yet Compiled/Linted)\n1. **Installed package**: `xlsx` installed via `install_applet_package`.\n2. **`/index.html` & `/src/index.css`**: Upgraded typography to `Plus Jakarta Sans` (display headings), `DM Sans` (body), `JetBrains Mono` (tabular metrics/IDs), and `Noto Sans Devanagari` (Hindi); updated title/meta to Smart Campus Attendance System.\n3. **`/src/types/index.ts`**: Rewritten cleanly with:\n   - `AttendanceStatus = \'present\' | \'absent\' | \'leave\'` (LATE completely removed).\n   - `UserRole = \'super_admin\' | \'admin\' | \'manager\' | \'member\' | \'parent\'`.\n   - New interfaces: `Department`, `AcademicClass`, `Subject`, `FacultyAssignment`, `TimetableSlot`, `ParentLink`, `AuditLog`.\n   - Enriched `Organization`, `UserProfile`, `AttendanceSession`, `AttendanceRecord`, `Announcement`, `AppNotification`.\n4. **`/src/utils/helpers.ts`**: Removed `isAfterLateTime`; added `normalizeAttendanceStatus`, `getOrgWeekdayIndex`, `parseHHMMToMinutes`, `timesOverlap`, `formatTimeRange12h`, `compressImageToDataUrl` (Spark-compatible JPEG data URL compression for student photos/college logos).\n5. **`/firestore.rules`**: Completely hardened:\n   - Strictly enforces `status in [\'present\', \'absent\', \'leave\']` (and `status == \'present\'` on self-marking).\n   - Fixed the Live Session `onSnapshot` query rule mismatch (`sessions` now statically allows `classId == myUser().classId` and `ownerUid == myUser().managerId` for students, and `ownerRole == \'admin\'` for managers).\n   - Enforces deterministic session-scoped attendance ID `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${uid}` so multiple subjects/day work independently without duplicates.\n   - Added security rules for `departments`, `classes`, `subjects`, `facultyAssignments`, `timetables`, `parentLinks`, strict read-only Parent access (`isParentOf(uid)`), Super Admin access, and **immutable** append-only `auditLogs` (`allow update: if false; allow delete: if false;`).\n6. **`/firestore.indexes.json`**: Added all required composite indexes (`sessions (orgId, classId, status)`, `sessions (orgId, ownerRole, status)`, `attendance (orgId, teacherUid, date)`, `users (orgId, classId)`, `facultyAssignments`, `timetables`, `parentLinks`, `auditLogs`, etc.).\n7. **New Services Created**:\n   - `/src/services/auditService.ts`: `recordAuditLog`, `fetchAuditLogs`.\n   - `/src/services/academicService.ts`: Full CRUD for departments, classes, subjects, faculty assignments, timetables (with `detectTimetableConflicts`), parent links (`verifyParentLink`, `rejectParentLink`, `linkParentDirectly`, `fetchLinkedStudentsForParent`), and `fetchAllOrganizations`.\n   - `/src/services/lowAttendanceService.ts`: `computeStudentAttendanceAnalysis` (accurate lecture-level denominator & subject-wise shortage) + `dispatchLowAttendanceAlerts` (deduplicated deterministic doc IDs to Student, Faculty, and Verified Parents).\n8. **Core Services Updated**:\n   - `/src/services/sessionService.ts`: Multi-teacher subject-wise `startAttendanceSession` (with duplicate open-session guard), `subscribeEligibleLiveSessions` & `findEligibleLiveSessions` (merges `classId` + legacy `managerId` queries with explicit `SessionStreamError` reporting instead of silent failure), `subscribeOwnerOpenSessions`, `fetchRecentSessionsByOwner`, `submitSelfAttendance` (strictly `\'present\'`, `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${uid}`, audit logged).\n   - `/src/services/attendanceService.ts`: LATE removed, `buildSessionAttendanceDocId` + subject-aware `buildAttendanceDocId`, `normalizeAttendanceStatus` on read, `fetchAttendanceForManager` covering both `teacherUid` and legacy `managerId`, `subscribeAttendanceForPerson` real-time listener, audit logging on manual/bulk/QR backup marks.\n\n### Not Yet Done (Remaining Work)\n- Remaining services (`orgService.ts`, `userService.ts`, `leaveService.ts`, `demoService.ts`) still need LATE removed, parent registration/linking & class enrollment helpers added, and audit logs wired.\n- Core shell & auth (`ProtectedRoute.tsx`, `Layout.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `LoginPage.tsx`, `RegisterPage.tsx`, `QRCardModal.tsx`, `PeopleManagerView.tsx`) need updates for 5-role RBAC, new routes (`/academics`, `/timetable`, `/parent`, `/audit-logs`, `/super-admin`), Digital ID Card PDF export + photo, and student class assignment.\n- All dashboards & feature pages need upgrading/creation (detailed in Next Steps below).\n- Translations (`en.json`, `hi.json`), `README.md`, and final `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + i18n parity verification.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n### Root Causes Identified for the Live Attendance Session Bug (\"No active session right now...\")\n1. **Firestore Rules Static Query Rejection (Primary Root Cause)**: Previously, `firestore.rules` required `sess.ownerRole == \'manager\' && myUser().managerId == sess.ownerUid` on `sessions` reads, while `subscribeActiveParentSession` queried `where(\'orgId\', \'==\', org.id), where(\'ownerUid\', \'==\', parentUid), where(\'status\', \'==\', \'open\')` **without** `where(\'ownerRole\', \'==\', \'manager\')`. Firestore\'s static query validator rejected the `onSnapshot` with `PERMISSION_DENIED`.\n2. **Silent Error Masking in UI**: The `onSnapshot` error callback executed `callback(null)` and `MarkYourAttendancePage` ignored `onError`, turning `permission-denied`, `failed-precondition` (missing index), and network errors into `\"No active session right now\"`.\n3. **Single-Teacher Lock-In**: Students could only query `ownerUid == profile.managerId`, preventing sessions started by a second teacher teaching another subject to the same class from ever appearing.\n4. **Daily Attendance Doc ID Collision**: Previously `buildAttendanceDocId` used `${orgId}_${date}_${personUid}`, causing two different subjects on the same day to collide (`alreadyMarked` or overwrite). Fixed to `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${personUid}` for live sessions and `${orgId}_${date}_${subjectId}_${personUid}` for manual subject attendance.\n\n### Spark Plan Compatibility Decisions\n- **Student Photos & College Logos**: Compressed client-side (`compressImageToDataUrl`, max 240px JPEG) and stored in Firestore doc fields (`photoUrl`, `logoUrl`) so zero paid Firebase Storage / Blaze plan setup is required.\n- **Backend Validation**: Authoritative 10-second QR expiry, GPS geofence, role/class eligibility, duplicate prevention, and immutable audit logs are enforced server-side via `firestore.rules` + Firestore `runTransaction` \342\200\224 100% Spark-plan compatible (no Blaze Cloud Functions required). Clearly note in final summary that automated scheduled background cron jobs (e.g. server-side email/SMS push when app is closed) would require Blaze Cloud Functions or an external scheduler, whereas in-app reminders, timetable slot session creation, and deduplicated low-attendance alerts work completely free on Spark.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No build/compile errors yet (compilation will run after all remaining files are updated).\n- Note: `orgService.ts`, `userService.ts`, `leaveService.ts`, `demoService.ts`, and several existing pages currently still reference `lateAfter`, `isAfterLateTime`, `\'late\'`, or the old `subscribeActiveParentSession` / `findActiveParentSession` / `markedLate` names \342\200\224 these will ALL be cleanly updated in the remaining batches before compiling.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Firebase project: `attendence-92251` (`src/firebase.ts` untouched).\n- `xlsx` is installed in `package.json`.\n- Foundation types, helpers, rules, indexes, `auditService`, `academicService`, `lowAttendanceService`, `sessionService`, and `attendanceService` are complete on disk.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Next Steps (Exact Priority Order)\n\n### Batch 3 \342\200\224 Remaining Services (`orgService.ts`, `userService.ts`, `leaveService.ts`, `demoService.ts`)\n1. **`/src/services/orgService.ts`**: Remove `lateAfter: \'09:30\'`; add optional `logoUrl`/`address`/`status`; log `settings.updated` audit log in `updateOrganization`.\n2. **`/src/services/userService.ts`**:\n   - Add `fetchUsersByClass(orgId, classId)`, `registerParentAccount(params)` (creates pending Parent account + `parentLinks` request using Org Code + Child\'s 6-char `userIds/{ID}` lookup so Parent links to verified Student), `addPersonDirect` support for `parent` role + academic class fields (`classId`, `className`, `departmentId`, `departmentName`, `courseName`, `semester`, `section`, `enrollmentNumber`, `photoUrl`), `updateUserDetails` allowing `photoUrl`, `enrollmentNumber`, `classId`, `className`, `departmentId`, `departmentName`, `courseName`, `semester`, `section`, and `updateUserRole(uid, role, actor)`.\n   - Wire `recordAuditLog` into `addPersonDirect`, `approvePendingUser`, `rejectPendingUser`, `setUserStatus`, `deleteUserProfile`.\n3. **`/src/services/leaveService.ts`**:\n   - Support `fetchLeavesForStudent(orgId, studentUid)` (for Parent Portal & Student Dashboard).\n   - Wire `recordAuditLog` into `createLeaveRequest` (`leave.requested`) and `decideLeaveRequest` (`leave.approved` / `leave.rejected`).\n   - Also notify verified `parentUids` if available or keep student notification clean.\n4. **`/src/services/demoService.ts`**:\n   - **Remove ALL `\'late\'` generation** (use ONLY `\'present\'`, `\'absent\'`, `\'leave\'`).\n   - Also seed sample Department (`Computer Science`), Class (`BCA AI & DS \302\267 Sem 2 \302\267 Sec C`), 2 Subjects (`Mathematics`, `Programming`), 2 Faculty Assignments (Teacher 1 -> Mathematics, Teacher 2 -> Programming), Timetable slots, and subject-wise attendance records using session-scoped doc IDs so the user can test multi-teacher/subject analytics immediately if they click Load Demo Data (and clean them up on Delete Demo Data).\n\n### Batch 4 \342\200\224 Shell, Routing, Digital ID Card, Auth & People Management\n5. **`/src/components/ProtectedRoute.tsx`**: Map all 5 roles in `getHomePathForRole` (`super_admin` -> `/super-admin`, `admin` -> `/admin`, `manager` -> `/manager`, `member` -> `/member`, `parent` -> `/parent`).\n6. **`/src/components/Layout.tsx`**: Modernize sidebar navigation for all 5 roles:\n   - `super_admin`: Organizations (`/super-admin`), Org Dashboard (`/admin`), Academics (`/academics`), Timetable (`/timetable`), Reports (`/reports`), Audit Logs (`/audit-logs`), Settings (`/settings`).\n   - `admin`: Dashboard (`/admin`), Start Attendance (`/attendance`), Academics (`/academics`), Timetable (`/timetable`), Teachers (`/admin/managers`), Students (`/admin/members`), Reports & Analytics (`/reports`), Leaves (`/leaves`), Announcements (`/announcements`), Audit Logs (`/audit-logs`), Settings (`/settings`).\n   - `manager`: Teacher Dashboard (`/manager`), Start Attendance (`/attendance`), Mark Your Attendance (`/mark`), Manual Backup (`/attendance/manual`), Timetable (`/timetable`), Students (`/manager/members`), Reports (`/reports`), Leaves (`/leaves`), Announcements (`/announcements`), Settings (`/settings`).\n   - `member`: Student Dashboard (`/member`), Mark Attendance (`/mark`), Timetable (`/timetable`), Leaves (`/leaves`), Announcements (`/announcements`), Settings (`/settings`).\n   - `parent`: Parent Portal (`/parent`), Timetable (`/timetable`), Announcements (`/announcements`), Settings (`/settings`).\n7. **`/src/components/QRCardModal.tsx`**: Upgrade into a professional **Digital Student ID Card** showing college name & logo, student photo (with initials fallback), Name, 6-char Unique ID, Enrollment/Roll Number, Department, Course, Semester, Section, QR code (`{ type: \'student_id\', orgId, uid, id }`) with explicit note that ID QR cannot independently authorize self-attendance, plus **Download Official PDF ID Card** (using `jsPDF`), Download PNG, and Print.\n8. **`/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx` & `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`**:\n   - Add **Parent** join option in `RegisterPage.tsx` (Org Code + Child\'s 6-char Student ID e.g. `PAN482` -> creates pending parent account + `parentLinks` request for Admin verification).\n   - Ensure `LoginPage.tsx` handles redirects cleanly for all 5 roles.\n9. **`/src/components/PeopleManagerView.tsx`**:\n   - Add Academic Class dropdown when adding/editing Students so Admins assign Students to `classId` (Course/Sem/Sec) directly; show Class/Section column; allow Admin to manage Parents or update roles cleanly.\n\n### Batch 5 \342\200\224 Live Session Pages (Fixing the Core Bug End-to-End)\n10. **`/src/pages/StartAttendancePage.tsx`**:\n    - Allow Teachers/Managers to select from **My Assigned Classes & Subjects** (loaded via `subscribeFacultyAssignments`) OR pick a **Today\'s Timetable Lecture** (with `?slotId=` URL support from Timetable / Teacher Dashboard). Enforce that Teachers only see/start sessions for their assigned classes/subjects (with fallback general option if org hasn\'t configured classes yet so legacy workflows never break).\n    - Support viewing/switching between multiple active sessions if needed, display LIVE badge, subject/class/room details, 10-second rotating QR + countdown, live PRESENT student feed (zero LATE!), and Stop Session button.\n    - Pass `profile` to `closeAttendanceSession(sessionId, profile)` for audit logging.\n11. **`/src/pages/MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`**:\n    - Replace old `subscribeActiveParentSession` / `findActiveParentSession` with `subscribeEligibleLiveSessions` / `findEligibleLiveSessions`.\n    - Display **ALL active eligible sessions** (e.g. if Teacher 1 and Teacher 2 both have open sessions, student can pick which session to mark, or scan any eligible QR directly!).\n    - Handle `loading`, `empty`, `permission-denied`, `network`, `index-required`, and `expired` states separately with clear actionable messages!\n    - Make the **Check again** button actually call `findEligibleLiveSessions` and refresh GPS + error states.\n    - Remove all LATE references; display strictly PRESENT upon success + subject name.\n12. **`/src/pages/MarkAttendancePage.tsx`**:\n    - Remove `\'late\'` from `STATUSES` (`[\'present\', \'absent\', \'leave\']` ONLY \342\200\224 3-column grid!).\n    - Add assigned Class & Subject selector for Teachers/Admins so manual & ID-card backup marking is subject-wise and includes class students (`fetchUsersByClass` + legacy `fetchManagerMembers`).\n\n### Batch 6 \342\200\224 Upgraded Role Dashboards & New Feature Pages\n13. **`/src/pages/ManagerDashboard.tsx` (Teacher Dashboard)**:\n    - Complete Teacher Dashboard: My Classes, My Assigned Subjects, My Lectures Today (from Timetable with upcoming lecture reminder banner & one-click **Start Attendance** button passing `?slotId=` or `?assignmentId=`), Active Sessions (real-time via `subscribeOwnerOpenSessions`), Today\'s Attendance (`PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE` \342\200\224 ZERO `LATE`), 7-day chart (`present`, `leave`, `absent`), Low Attendance (<75%) list with **Send Alerts** button, Pending Leaves, Recent Attendance History, Quick Export link.\n14. **`/src/pages/MemberDashboard.tsx` (Student Performance Dashboard)**:\n    - Real-time `subscribeEligibleLiveSessions` banner at top (auto-updates without reload when any assigned teacher starts/closes a session, with direct **Scan QR** / **Enter Code** buttons!).\n    - Student Profile & Digital ID Card preview + Download PDF button.\n    - **Today\'s Lectures** card (from `subscribeTimetableForClass` merged with real-time `subscribeAttendanceForPerson` + live sessions): shows Subject Name, Teacher Name, Lecture Time, Live Session indicator, and status (`PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE`, or `NOT STARTED`).\n    - **Overall Attendance %** + **75% Shortage Warning Banner** (with subject-wise shortage breakdown).\n    - **Subject-wise Attendance %** bar chart & progress cards.\n    - **Weekly Trend / Monthly Calendar** (strictly PRESENT / ABSENT / LEAVE \342\200\224 ZERO LATE!).\n    - Recent Attendance History, Leave History, and Upcoming Timetable.\n15. **`/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx`**:\n    - Remove ALL `late` stats/bars (replace 4th stat with `Leave Today` and chart bars strictly `present`, `leave`, `absent`).\n    - Add Low-Attendance Alert summary widget (students below threshold + one-click **Send Alerts**), Pending Parent Link Verification requests, Quick links to Academics, Timetable, Analytics, Audit Logs.\n16. **NEW `/src/pages/AcademicsPage.tsx`** (`/academics` \342\200\224 Admin/Super Admin):\n    - Clean tabbed management for **Departments**, **Classes / Courses / Semesters / Sections / Classrooms**, **Subjects**, **Faculty Assignments**, and **Parent Link Requests** (approve/reject pending parent requests or directly link a Parent to a Student).\n17. **NEW `/src/pages/TimetablePage.tsx`** (`/timetable` \342\200\224 All roles):\n    - Weekly timetable (Mon\342\200\223Sat) with filter by Class or Teacher.\n    - Admin form to add/delete slots with **live conflict detection** (flags teacher, class, or room overlap before saving).\n    - For Teachers: highlights upcoming lecture reminder + one-click **Start Attendance** button (`/attendance?slotId=...`).\n18. **NEW `/src/pages/ParentDashboard.tsx`** (`/parent` \342\200\224 Parent role):\n    - Secure read-only Parent Portal for linked students (`fetchLinkedStudentsForParent`): child selector (if multiple linked children), Overall %, 75% Low-Attendance Alert banner, Subject-wise Attendance breakdown & chart, Attendance History table, Leave Applications & Approval Status, Upcoming Timetable, and **Download Report (PDF & Excel)**.\n19. **NEW `/src/pages/AuditLogsPage.tsx`** (`/audit-logs` \342\200\224 Admin/Super Admin):\n    - Filterable immutable audit log viewer (filter by action category, role, search text) showing timestamp, actor name/role, action, target, summary, and CSV/PDF export.\n20. **NEW `/src/pages/SuperAdminDashboard.tsx`** (`/super-admin` \342\200\224 Super Admin role):\n    - Multi-organization overview (`fetchAllOrganizations`), system summary stats, org code/type/status management, and link to current org workspace.\n\n### Batch 7 \342\200\224 Advanced Analytics, Excel/PDF Reports, Settings, i18n, App Router & README\n21. **`/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx`**:\n    - Remove ALL `late` columns, filters, chart bars, and `P+L` labels (use strictly `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE` and `P` total).\n    - Add **Analytics** tab (Overall %, Weekly/Monthly trend graph, Subject-wise attendance chart, Department/Class-wise breakdown, Students Below Threshold list with one-click deduplicated **Send Alerts** button).\n    - Add Department, Class/Section, and Subject filters alongside Date Range, Student, and Status (`present` / `absent` / `leave`).\n    - Add **Export Excel (.xlsx)** via `xlsx` (multi-sheet workbook: Executive Summary, Subject-wise, Detailed Records, Low Attendance) AND upgrade **Export PDF** with college branding, generation timestamp, filter context, and clean PRESENT/ABSENT/LEAVE formatting.\n22. **`/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`**:\n    - Remove `lateAfter` input completely!\n    - Add **Student Photo Upload** (Spark-compatible compressed data URL) + Enrollment Number in Profile section.\n    - Add **College Logo Upload** & Address in Admin Org Settings (for ID Cards & PDF Reports) + configurable Low Attendance Threshold (default 75%).\n23. **`/src/App.tsx`**: Register `/academics`, `/timetable`, `/parent`, `/audit-logs`, `/super-admin`, and include `super_admin` in admin-capable routes and `parent` in shared routes (`/timetable`, `/announcements`, `/settings`).\n24. **`/src/i18n/en.json` & `/src/i18n/hi.json`**: Remove obsolete `late` strings (or ensure zero UI references to `late`) and add complete English + Hindi keys for all new features with exact 100% key parity.\n25. **`/README.md`**: Document the complete Smart Campus Attendance Management System architecture, schema, Firestore rules/indexes deployment, Spark-plan compatibility & paid-plan notes, and root cause fix.\n\n### Batch 8 \342\200\224 Final Verification\n26. Run `grep -rnEi \'\\blate\\b|lateAfter|markedLate|face|biometric|liveness|embedding\' src firestore.rules` to verify ZERO unwanted Late or Biometric code remains (only safe normalization comment in `helpers.ts` / `front|user` camera regex).\n27. Co-execute `compile_applet`, `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`), and the `en.json` vs `hi.json` key-parity Node check in parallel. Fix any issues until all pass with 0 errors.\n28. Provide the clear final summary requested by the user covering all 7 items: Files modified, Features implemented, Live session issue & root cause, Firebase schema & security rule changes, Required Firestore indexes, Tests/verifications performed, and Spark-plan / remaining limitations.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Strictly ONLY 3 attendance statuses: `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE`. ZERO `LATE` anywhere.\n- Strictly ZERO face recognition, facial verification, biometrics, or liveness features.\n- Keep QR + GPS + Firebase Auth + Firestore Security Rules architecture intact on `attendence-92251`.\n- Never weaken `firestore.rules` to make features work; keep `sessionSecrets` strictly owner-only, `auditLogs` strictly immutable, and `parent` strictly read-only for linked children only.\n- Follow `frontend-design` + `3_saas_dashboard.md` rules: no pill-wrapped static metadata, no thick left accent borders (`border-l-4`), tabular numerals on all metrics/tables, clean dual-theme light/dark pairing, single-elevation flat borders, no dead/mock buttons.\n- Do not modify `src/firebase.ts` credentials.\n</summary>"
