  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nComplete production-quality upgrade of the existing **Smart Attendance System** (`attendence-92251` Firebase project, React 19 + Vite 8 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4) into a **Smart Campus Attendance Management System**, preserving existing working functionality and full **Firebase Spark (free) plan compatibility**.\n\n### Strict Constraints & Deliverables\n1. **Remove LATE Attendance Completely**: ONLY 3 attendance statuses allowed across the entire app: `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE` (`\'present\' | \'absent\' | \'leave\'`). Legacy `\'late\'` Firestore records are normalized safely to `\'present\'` via `normalizeAttendanceStatus()`.\n2. **ZERO Face Recognition / Biometric / Liveness Features**: Strictly QR + GPS + Firebase Auth + Firestore rules only.\n3. **Fix Live Attendance Session Issue**: Fix `\"No active session right now...\"` end-to-end across `firestore.rules`, `sessionService.ts`, `StartAttendancePage.tsx`, `MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`, and `MemberDashboard.tsx`. Real-time `onSnapshot()` updates, multi-teacher concurrent sessions, separate handling of `loading`, `empty`, `permission-denied`, `index-required`, `network`, and `expired` states, plus working **Check again** retry button.\n4. **Multiple Teachers & Independent Subject-Wise Attendance**: Multiple teachers independently manage subject-wise live sessions for the same class on the same day using independent `sessionId`s and deterministic attendance doc ID `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${personUid}` (manual subject backup uses `${orgId}_${date}_${subjectId}_${personUid}`).\n5. **5-Role RBAC**: `super_admin`, `admin`, `manager` (Teacher), `member` (Student), `parent` (strictly read-only linked child portal).\n6. **Additional Features**: Digital Student ID Card (photo + PDF download), Academic Structure (`/academics`), Smart Timetable with Conflict Detection (`/timetable`), Low Attendance Alert System (75% default, deduplicated notifications), Immutable Audit Logs (`/audit-logs`), Advanced Analytics & Excel (`.xlsx`) + branded PDF reports (`/reports`), modernized UI/UX + English & Hindi i18n, and updated `README.md`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n\n### Completed & Saved on Disk (NOT Yet Compiled/Linted)\n1. **Dependencies**: `xlsx` installed in `package.json`.\n2. **HTML & Styling**: `/index.html`, `/src/index.css` (`Plus Jakarta Sans`, `DM Sans`, `JetBrains Mono`, `Noto Sans Devanagari`).\n3. **Types & Helpers**: `/src/types/index.ts`, `/src/utils/helpers.ts` (`AttendanceStatus = \'present\' | \'absent\' | \'leave\'`, `UserRole` 5-role union, `normalizeAttendanceStatus`, `compressImageToDataUrl`, `timesOverlap`, `formatTimeRange12h`, `getOrgWeekdayIndex`, etc.).\n4. **Firebase Rules & Indexes**: `/firestore.rules` (static query-safe `sessions` rules fixing `PERMISSION_DENIED`, strict `status in [\'present\', \'absent\', \'leave\']`, session-scoped attendance doc IDs, immutable append-only `auditLogs`, read-only `isParentOf(uid)`, academic collections) and `/firestore.indexes.json` (all required composite indexes).\n5. **All Services Complete**:\n   - `/src/services/auditService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/academicService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/lowAttendanceService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/sessionService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/attendanceService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/orgService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/userService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/leaveService.ts`\n   - `/src/services/demoService.ts` (zero `late`, seeds Department + Classes + Subjects + Faculty Assignments + Timetable + Subject-wise attendance)\n6. **Shell, Auth, ID Card & People Management Complete**:\n   - `/src/components/ProtectedRoute.tsx` (5-role `getHomePathForRole`)\n   - `/src/components/Layout.tsx` (5-role navigation sidebar & mobile nav)\n   - `/src/components/QRCardModal.tsx` (Official Digital Student ID Card with photo, enrollment no., academic metadata, QR security notice, jsPDF card download, PNG & Print)\n   - `/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx` (Added Parent registration via Org Code + Child\'s 6-char Student ID)\n   - `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx` (5-role redirect handling)\n   - `/src/components/PeopleManagerView.tsx` (Academic class assignment, class filter, enrollment number, audit logging)\n7. **Live Session & Manual Marking Pages Complete**:\n   - `/src/pages/StartAttendancePage.tsx` (Multi-teacher subject-wise sessions, today\'s lectures quick-pick, `?slotId=`/`?assignmentId=`, duplicate open-session prevention, zero LATE)\n   - `/src/pages/MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx` (`subscribeEligibleLiveSessions` + `findEligibleLiveSessions`, multi-session selector, explicit error states, working Check again button, zero LATE, camera regex `/front|user/i`)\n   - `/src/pages/MarkAttendancePage.tsx` (Strictly 3 statuses `present`/`absent`/`leave`, subject-wise class selector)\n8. **All Role Dashboards & New Feature Pages Complete**:\n   - `/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx` (Zero LATE, Leave Today, Low Attendance Alert widget + Send Alerts button, Quick Campus links)\n   - `/src/pages/ManagerDashboard.tsx` (Full Teacher Dashboard: Active Sessions, My Lectures Today, My Assigned Subjects, PRESENT/LEAVE/ABSENT KPIs & chart, Low Attendance + Send Alerts)\n   - `/src/pages/MemberDashboard.tsx` (Full Student Performance Dashboard: real-time Active Live Sessions banner, 75% shortage warning, Digital Student ID preview, Today\'s Lectures with `PRESENT`/`ABSENT`/`LEAVE`/`NOT STARTED` + live indicator, Subject-wise %, Monthly Calendar with Present/Absent/Leave, Leave History)\n   - `/src/pages/AcademicsPage.tsx` (Departments, Classes/Sections, Subjects, Faculty Assignments, Parent Verification & Direct Linking)\n   - `/src/pages/TimetablePage.tsx` (Weekly Mon\342\200\223Sat grid, live teacher/class/room conflict detection, 1-click Start Attendance)\n   - `/src/pages/ParentDashboard.tsx` (Read-only linked children portal, 75% alert, subject chart, leaves, PDF & Excel export)\n   - `/src/pages/AuditLogsPage.tsx` (Immutable audit log viewer with filters & Excel export)\n   - `/src/pages/SuperAdminDashboard.tsx` (Multi-organization overview)\n\n### Remaining Work (Only Batch 7 & Batch 8 Left!)\n- `/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx` \342\200\224 still has old `late` references; needs Analytics tab, Department/Class/Subject filters, Excel (`.xlsx`) export, branded PDF export, and zero `late`.\n- `/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx` \342\200\224 still has old `lateAfter` input; needs `lateAfter` removed, Student Photo upload (`compressImageToDataUrl`) + Enrollment Number, and Admin College Logo upload + Address.\n- `/src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 needs new routes registered (`/academics`, `/timetable`, `/parent`, `/audit-logs`, `/super-admin`) and `super_admin`/`parent` added to `allowedRoles`.\n- `/src/i18n/en.json` & `/src/i18n/hi.json` \342\200\224 remove `late` strings from active UI keys and add all new English + Hindi keys used by the upgraded/new pages with 100% key parity.\n- `/README.md` \342\200\224 update documentation for the upgraded Smart Campus system.\n- Also check `/src/pages/PendingApprovalPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/LeavesPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/AnnouncementsPage.tsx`, `/src/context/AuthContext.tsx` via grep to verify zero remaining `late` / `lateAfter` / `face` / `biometric` references anywhere.\n- Final `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + i18n parity check.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Live Session Bug Root Causes Fixed**:\n  1. `firestore.rules` required `sess.ownerRole == \'manager\' && myUser().managerId == sess.ownerUid`, while the old query omitted `where(\'ownerRole\', \'==\', \'manager\')` causing Firestore static query rejection (`PERMISSION_DENIED`).\n  2. UI `onSnapshot` error callback previously swallowed errors into `callback(null)`, masking permission/index/network failures as `\"No active session right now\"`.\n  3. Students were previously locked to a single `managerId` instead of their `classId`, blocking multi-teacher subject sessions.\n  4. Old daily attendance doc ID `${orgId}_${date}_${personUid}` caused subject collisions on the same day; now `${orgId}_${sessionId}_${personUid}` (live) and `${orgId}_${date}_${subjectId}_${personUid}` (manual subject).\n- **Unused Icon Note**: Check `ParentDashboard.tsx` line 21 \342\200\224 `Download` was imported from `lucide-react`; verify if `lint_applet` / `tsc` flags unused imports and remove `Download` if unused.\n- **Spark Plan Compatibility**: Student photos & college logos use compressed base64 JPEG data URLs in Firestore (`compressImageToDataUrl`, max 240px) \342\200\224 zero paid Firebase Storage needed. All enforcement is via `firestore.rules` + transactions.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No compile/lint runs yet (deferred until Batch 7 edits are complete).\n- Known minor cleanup to check during Batch 7/8: unused `Download` import in `/src/pages/ParentDashboard.tsx` (remove if flagged by TypeScript/ESLint).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Firebase project: `attendence-92251` (`src/firebase.ts` unchanged).\n- All services, types, rules, indexes, shell components, live session pages, dashboards, and all 5 new pages are written on disk.\n- Only `ReportsPage.tsx`, `SettingsPage.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `en.json`, `hi.json`, `README.md` remain before verification.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Next Steps (Exact Order)\n\n1. **Inspect remaining files in parallel**: `view_file` on `/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/i18n/en.json`, `/src/i18n/hi.json`.\n2. **Update `/src/pages/ReportsPage.tsx`**:\n   - Completely remove `late` columns, filters, chart bars, and `P+L` labels (strictly `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE`).\n   - Add **Analytics** tab (Overall %, Daily/Weekly Trend chart, Subject-wise Attendance BarChart, Class-wise breakdown, Students Below Threshold list with one-click deduplicated **Send Alerts** button via `dispatchLowAttendanceAlerts`).\n   - Add Department, Class/Section, and Subject filters alongside Date Range, Student, and Status (`present` | `absent` | `leave`).\n   - Add **Export Excel (.xlsx)** via `xlsx` (multi-sheet: Summary, Subject-wise, Detailed Records, Low Attendance) + upgraded branded **Export PDF** (`jsPDF` + `autoTable` with org logo/name, date range, filter summary, generation timestamp, PRESENT/ABSENT/LEAVE totals).\n3. **Update `/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx`**:\n   - Completely remove `lateAfter` state & input.\n   - Add **Profile Photo Upload** (using `compressImageToDataUrl(file, 220, 0.78)`) and **Enrollment Number** input so students can upload their ID card photo cleanly on Spark plan.\n   - Add **College Logo Upload** (`compressImageToDataUrl(file, 200, 0.8)`) & **Campus Address** in Admin Org Settings + configurable Low Attendance Threshold (default 75%).\n   - Pass `profile` as `actor` to `updateOrganization(..., profile)`.\n4. **Update `/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Import and register routes:\n     - `/super-admin` (`allowedRoles={[\'super_admin\']}`) -> `SuperAdminDashboard`\n     - `/academics` (`allowedRoles={[\'admin\', \'super_admin\']}`) -> `AcademicsPage`\n     - `/timetable` (`allowedRoles={[\'super_admin\', \'admin\', \'manager\', \'member\', \'parent\']}`) -> `TimetablePage`\n     - `/parent` (`allowedRoles={[\'parent\']}`) -> `ParentDashboard`\n     - `/audit-logs` (`allowedRoles={[\'admin\', \'super_admin\']}`) -> `AuditLogsPage`\n   - Update existing admin routes (`/admin`, `/admin/managers`, `/admin/members`) to include `\'super_admin\'`, and shared routes (`/announcements`, `/settings`) to include `\'super_admin\'` and `\'parent\'`.\n   - Also remove unused `Download` import from `/src/pages/ParentDashboard.tsx`.\n5. **Update `/src/i18n/en.json` & `/src/i18n/hi.json`**:\n   - Remove obsolete `late` / `lateToday` / `lateAfter` keys (verify no component references them).\n   - Add EVERY new translation key used across `Layout.tsx`, `QRCardModal.tsx`, `RegisterPage.tsx`, `PeopleManagerView.tsx`, `StartAttendancePage.tsx`, `MarkYourAttendancePage.tsx`, `AdminDashboard.tsx`, `ManagerDashboard.tsx`, `MemberDashboard.tsx`, `AcademicsPage.tsx`, `TimetablePage.tsx`, `ParentDashboard.tsx`, `AuditLogsPage.tsx`, `SuperAdminDashboard.tsx`, `ReportsPage.tsx`, `SettingsPage.tsx`:\n     - `common`: `superAdmin`, `parent`, `today`, `saved`, `deleted`\n     - `nav`: `organizations`, `academics`, `timetable`, `auditLogs`, `parentPortal`\n     - `auth`: `joinRoleParent`, `childStudentIdLabel`, `relationshipLabel`, `studentIdRequired`, `studentIdNotFound`\n     - `qr`: `digitalIdTitle`, `officialCardLabel`, `enrollmentNo`, `idCardSecurityNote`, `downloadPdf`, `openDigitalIdBtn`\n     - `session`: `startedToast`, `duplicateSessionErr`, `resumeActivePrompt`, `todayLecturesQuickPick`, `selectAssignedSubject`, `generalStaffSession`, `subjectScopeHint`\n     - `mark`: `markAnotherSession`, `sessionPermErrorTitle`, `sessionIndexErrorTitle`, `sessionNetworkErrorTitle`, `multipleLiveSessions`, `codeShort`\n     - `dashboard`: `leaveToday`\n     - `alerts`: `dispatchedToast`, `sendAlertsBtn`, `shortageWarningTitle`, `overallShortageDesc`, `subjectShortageDesc`\n     - `teacher`: `dashboardTitle`, `activeSessions`, `openLiveView`, `myLecturesToday`, `noLecturesToday`, `startLectureBtn`, `myAssignedSubjects`, `noAssignedSubjects`, `startShort`\n     - `student`: `dashboardTitle`, `activeLiveSessionsTitle`, `overallRate`, `todaysLectures`, `noLecturesToday`, `notStarted`, `subjectWiseTitle`\n     - `academics`: `title`, `subtitle`, `quickCardDesc`, `tabAssignments`, `tabClasses`, `tabSubjects`, `tabDepartments`, `tabParents`, `assignFacultyTitle`, `assignFacultyHint`, `teacher`, `classSection`, `allClasses`, `unassigned`, `subject`, `assignBtn`, `assignmentExists`, `noAssignments`, `addClassTitle`, `department`, `courseName`, `semester`, `section`, `classroom`, `addClassBtn`, `noClasses`, `addSubjectTitle`, `subjectName`, `subjectCode`, `addSubjectBtn`, `noSubjects`, `addDeptTitle`, `deptCode`, `addDeptBtn`, `noDepts`, `directLinkParentTitle`, `directLinkParentHint`, `student`, `linkBtn`, `noParentLinks`, `parentLinkedToast`, `parentVerifiedToast`\n     - `timetable`: `title`, `subtitle`, `quickCardDesc`, `allTeachers`, `addSlotTitle`, `day`, `startTime`, `endTime`, `addSlotBtn`, `conflictDetected`, `conflictBlocked`, `emptyTitle`, `emptyDesc`, `noClassesDay`\n     - `parent`: `title`, `subtitle`, `noLinkedStudentTitle`, `noLinkedStudentDesc`, `readOnlyNote`, `leaveStatusTitle`\n     - `audit`: `title`, `subtitle`, `quickCardDesc`, `searchPlaceholder`, `allActions`, `emptyTitle`, `time`, `actor`, `action`, `summary`\n     - `superAdmin`: `title`, `subtitle`, `openCurrentOrg`, `totalOrgs`, `activeWorkspace`\n     - `reports` & `settings`: all new analytics/excel/photo/logo/address keys added in steps 2 & 3.\n6. **Update `/README.md`**: Document the complete Smart Campus architecture, schema, security rules & indexes deployment (`firebase deploy --only firestore:rules,firestore:indexes`), live session bug root cause & fix, and Spark-plan vs Blaze-plan notes.\n7. **Run Comprehensive Verification**:\n   - Run grep via `run_command` to verify ZERO `late`, `lateAfter`, `markedLate`, `face`, `biometric`, `liveness`, or `embedding` references remain across `src/` and `firestore.rules` (except the safe legacy `\'late\' -> \'present\'` normalizer in `helpers.ts` if kept).\n   - Run Node script verifying 100% key parity between `src/i18n/en.json` and `src/i18n/hi.json` AND that every `t(\'...\')` key used in `src/` exists in both JSON files!\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel and resolve any TypeScript/lint errors until 0 errors remain.\n8. **Deliver Final Summary** covering all 7 items requested by the user:\n   1. Files modified / created\n   2. Features implemented\n   3. Live session issue & root cause fix\n   4. Firebase schema & security rule changes\n   5. Required Firestore indexes\n   6. Tests & verifications performed\n   7. Spark-plan compatibility & remaining limitations (e.g., automated server-side cron email/SMS push when app is closed requires Blaze Cloud Functions).\n\n---\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Strictly ONLY 3 attendance statuses: `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LEAVE`. ZERO `LATE` anywhere in UI, logic, reports, charts, settings, or rules.\n- Strictly ZERO face recognition, facial verification, biometrics, or liveness features.\n- Keep `src/firebase.ts` credentials (`attendence-92251`) untouched.\n- Never weaken `firestore.rules`; keep `sessionSecrets` owner-only, `auditLogs` immutable, and `parent` strictly read-only for linked children.\n- Maintain clean SaaS UI/UX (no pill-wrapped static metadata, no thick left accent borders, tabular numerals on metrics/tables, light/dark support).\n</summary>"
