            lines {
              text: "  - **Strict 10-second backend TTL**: Only the currently active token/code is accepted (`request.time <= secret.tokenUpdatedAt + duration.value(10, \'s\')` and `secret.active == true`). Previous tokens and ended sessions are immediately rejected by Firestore on the server."
